1
00:02:17,066 --> 00:02:22,085
Oh, the light of my eyes...
The fire of my heart...

2
00:02:23,366 --> 00:02:25,245
Is she alive?

3
00:02:29,086 --> 00:02:30,205
Alaca.

4
00:02:31,486 --> 00:02:33,285
Alaca. Is she..

5
00:02:34,686 --> 00:02:38,685
Bala who cures with her hands
and heals with her heart is alive?

6
00:02:39,926 --> 00:02:43,005
You feel too, right?
You fell Bala too.

7
00:02:43,126 --> 00:02:44,925
That's why you've come up here.

8
00:02:45,286 --> 00:02:47,165
Is that why you showed me the way?

9
00:02:47,286 --> 00:02:52,045
Hey, is she alive? You can't
contain yourself either, right?

10
00:02:52,206 --> 00:02:55,125
If only you knew the storms
breaking up in my heart.

11
00:02:55,646 --> 00:02:58,165
If only you knew Alaca.

12
00:03:00,406 --> 00:03:04,605
You felt her. That's why you have come here.

13
00:03:04,886 --> 00:03:07,205
My Bala..

14
00:03:10,366 --> 00:03:11,565
You're alive.

15
00:03:11,966 --> 00:03:15,925
You are alive...
You've sent Alaca to me.

16
00:03:17,406 --> 00:03:20,045
Oh my dear...
Let's go.

17
00:03:22,966 --> 00:03:24,485
Come on.

18
00:03:25,806 --> 00:03:28,965
There must be some trails around here.

19
00:03:29,606 --> 00:03:33,165
There must be some trails around
here. Some trails around here.

20
00:03:33,406 --> 00:03:35,165
Around here..

21
00:03:35,726 --> 00:03:38,125
Oh these trails...

22
00:03:38,766 --> 00:03:40,885
Trails..
Trails..

23
00:03:42,806 --> 00:03:45,845
They captured Bala.

24
00:03:46,326 --> 00:03:47,965
They imprisoned her.

25
00:03:48,206 --> 00:03:50,245
Oh no...
These trails...

26
00:03:51,006 --> 00:03:52,445
Trails..

27
00:03:53,806 --> 00:03:55,365
These trails...

28
00:04:04,606 --> 00:04:06,125
Halime.

29
00:04:10,006 --> 00:04:12,845
Was that why you appeared
in my dreams, my daughter?

30
00:04:13,126 --> 00:04:15,245
My Halime's talisman.

31
00:04:45,126 --> 00:04:46,765
Halime, is that you?

32
00:04:47,046 --> 00:04:49,005
Are you here, my daughter?

33
00:04:50,006 --> 00:04:51,365
My Halime.

34
00:04:53,926 --> 00:04:55,525
Is that you my dear?

35
00:04:55,886 --> 00:04:57,525
Are you here my dear?

36
00:04:57,766 --> 00:04:59,605
Wait.
Don't go.

37
00:05:00,686 --> 00:05:02,485
I couldn't realize.

38
00:05:04,126 --> 00:05:07,085
I couldn't realize the reason
of those dreams, my dear.

39
00:05:18,886 --> 00:05:20,885
My Osman..

40
00:05:22,166 --> 00:05:24,325
Our daughter is alive, Osman.

41
00:05:25,846 --> 00:05:28,405
Our precious is alive.

42
00:05:35,846 --> 00:05:39,685
Thank God, I raised her. What if you did?

43
00:05:42,766 --> 00:05:44,645
It would be a pity.

44
00:05:49,606 --> 00:05:51,885
Sofia.

45
00:05:57,366 --> 00:05:59,045
Where is my daughter?

46
00:06:00,406 --> 00:06:02,525
Where is my Halime, Sofia?

47
00:06:02,846 --> 00:06:05,525
Sofia, don't go. Don't go!

48
00:06:05,766 --> 00:06:10,005
Don't run away! Where is my daughter?
Where is my Halime? She is my daughter Sofia!

49
00:06:10,606 --> 00:06:13,165
Where is my daughter? Sofia!

50
00:06:14,246 --> 00:06:16,565
Sofia!

51
00:06:17,766 --> 00:06:20,125
Demon!

52
00:06:29,686 --> 00:06:31,965
What are you doing here?

53
00:06:32,206 --> 00:06:34,365
-Is what I heard true?
-What did you hear?

54
00:06:34,606 --> 00:06:37,205
Don't you lie to me! I heard everything!

55
00:06:37,406 --> 00:06:40,365
Osman and Bala's daughter... Is Halime alive?

56
00:06:47,566 --> 00:06:49,685
What did you mean?

57
00:06:51,046 --> 00:06:53,205
You said you took away her daughter.

58
00:06:54,126 --> 00:06:57,005
You said you raised her.
You said...

59
00:07:05,286 --> 00:07:07,525
You said she remembers nothing.

60
00:07:15,166 --> 00:07:18,325
Did you...

61
00:07:18,326 --> 00:07:21,245
Let's go to your room. Not here.

62
00:07:22,366 --> 00:07:24,325
Let's go.
Let's go.

63
00:07:39,126 --> 00:07:42,805
Meals shall be cooked! Tables shall be set!

64
00:07:43,886 --> 00:07:46,165
Celebrate our glorious victory!

65
00:07:49,766 --> 00:07:51,165
Osman..

66
00:07:53,406 --> 00:07:56,605
He ran away without looking behind.

67
00:07:58,646 --> 00:08:00,165
In the woods,

68
00:08:00,966 --> 00:08:03,445
...he defeated us with his mind.

69
00:08:04,046 --> 00:08:08,205
Yet we keep the heart of the state.

70
00:08:09,806 --> 00:08:12,645
We are the winner.

71
00:08:14,406 --> 00:08:16,245
Yet Osman is still alive.

72
00:08:16,806 --> 00:08:21,045
-That means hope for his people.
-He's going to die!

73
00:08:22,086 --> 00:08:25,325
Ilbay, he's going to die.

74
00:08:26,806 --> 00:08:29,525
Nobody has ever got rid of Ulugan's clutches.

75
00:08:29,766 --> 00:08:31,605
Neither will Osman.

76
00:08:36,806 --> 00:08:38,445
I will...

77
00:08:39,885 --> 00:08:42,725
..take the hope out of people's hearts.

78
00:08:44,326 --> 00:08:45,965
He's going to die for sure.

79
00:08:46,486 --> 00:08:50,085
With Bala, we already
took out the half of his heart.

80
00:08:53,766 --> 00:08:56,365
Yet I'm curious.

81
00:08:58,366 --> 00:09:01,685
Sofia was with us when we
went to look for Bala Hatun.

82
00:09:02,246 --> 00:09:04,605
But she hasn't been around.

83
00:09:05,006 --> 00:09:07,125
She wasn't leading her army either.

84
00:09:07,886 --> 00:09:10,325
Where was Sofia when Osman attacked?

85
00:09:12,406 --> 00:09:15,005
What are you chewing in your mouth, woman?

86
00:09:15,886 --> 00:09:18,565
Just spill the beans.
What are you trying to say?

87
00:09:19,206 --> 00:09:23,125
I'm saying that red demon can do anything.

88
00:09:23,446 --> 00:09:25,645
We should hold her leash tightly.

89
00:09:25,726 --> 00:09:28,765
I'm quite sure that she's up to something.

90
00:09:32,446 --> 00:09:34,725
I don't give an ear to a woman's words.

91
00:09:36,526 --> 00:09:38,485
But at times..

92
00:09:39,366 --> 00:09:41,685
...you say right things.

93
00:09:44,446 --> 00:09:45,965
Altuga.

94
00:09:46,366 --> 00:09:47,765
Prepare the horses.

95
00:09:48,046 --> 00:09:50,405
-We're going to Akhisar.
-Ulugan.

96
00:10:03,086 --> 00:10:05,245
Tracks. Tracks..

97
00:10:07,606 --> 00:10:08,685
Tracks...

98
00:10:12,766 --> 00:10:13,805
Tracks!

99
00:10:14,846 --> 00:10:18,245
The tracks disappear here.
Where did they take her?

100
00:10:19,446 --> 00:10:24,885
My Allah... Where did they take her? No... No...

101
00:10:24,886 --> 00:10:28,645
No...

102
00:10:35,046 --> 00:10:37,085
Is someone playing a game, huh?

103
00:10:37,966 --> 00:10:39,925
Is someone playing a game with me?

104
00:10:40,406 --> 00:10:44,605
No... no..

105
00:10:44,606 --> 00:10:46,645
No! No!

106
00:10:46,646 --> 00:10:48,565
I will not lose hope.

107
00:10:48,566 --> 00:10:53,765
I will not give up hope.
No. Right? Right, Alaca?

108
00:10:53,846 --> 00:10:59,125
Right? Otherwise, you wouldn't have
brought me all the way here. Right, Alaca?

109
00:10:59,486 --> 00:11:02,765
Otherwise, you wouldn't have
made me search for Bala like this.

110
00:11:02,846 --> 00:11:03,885
No.

111
00:11:04,006 --> 00:11:06,445
With the help of my Allah, we will do this.

112
00:11:12,806 --> 00:11:14,165
In my heart..

113
00:11:14,806 --> 00:11:16,725
Right here in my heart...

114
00:11:17,646 --> 00:11:21,365
I feel she is still alive.

115
00:11:21,366 --> 00:11:23,165
With my Allah's help...

116
00:11:24,086 --> 00:11:25,845
...we will find Bala.

117
00:11:27,046 --> 00:11:29,845
We will. Surely we will.

118
00:11:31,166 --> 00:11:33,765
We will find her.

119
00:11:38,326 --> 00:11:42,805
Who did this? Who did this?
-Begum Hatun, my Bey...

120
00:11:47,646 --> 00:11:48,885
He is right.

121
00:11:48,886 --> 00:11:51,845
Begum Hatun made this treacherous move.

122
00:11:52,726 --> 00:11:55,045
She got on her horse and went this way.

123
00:11:55,166 --> 00:11:56,365
Begum..

124
00:11:57,806 --> 00:12:00,165
What tricks are you playing, huh?

125
00:12:02,126 --> 00:12:06,605
I will find you, and then you
will see what I will do to you.

126
00:12:06,686 --> 00:12:08,685
You will see what I will do to you.

127
00:12:13,486 --> 00:12:17,165
Tell me something! What I heard is confusing me.

128
00:12:17,166 --> 00:12:21,045
What is confusing you. Poena? Tell me!

129
00:12:21,046 --> 00:12:23,205
Is Halime really alive?

130
00:12:24,446 --> 00:12:26,565
If you raised her then I...

131
00:12:31,166 --> 00:12:32,405
Unless..

132
00:12:36,926 --> 00:12:38,845
Unless Halime is me..
-Poena!

133
00:12:42,086 --> 00:12:46,085
Have you become stupid since
you started living with them?

134
00:12:47,046 --> 00:12:50,245
Or have you forgotten who I am?

135
00:12:50,246 --> 00:12:52,045
What are you trying to say?

136
00:12:53,086 --> 00:12:54,125
Poena.

137
00:12:55,486 --> 00:12:57,405
Halime is dead.

138
00:12:59,366 --> 00:13:02,365
While they are alive, I want Bala and Osman...

139
00:13:02,886 --> 00:13:07,805
...to feel the same pain we
have felt. Do you understand me?

140
00:13:10,766 --> 00:13:13,765
So did you lie to them?

141
00:13:16,806 --> 00:13:18,565
Of course, I lied.

142
00:13:20,246 --> 00:13:24,245
If I had done such a thing,
wouldn't I have told you?

143
00:13:25,606 --> 00:13:27,765
I thought that...

144
00:13:28,806 --> 00:13:31,765
Come. Come, my little bird come.

145
00:13:32,086 --> 00:13:33,325
Sit down.

146
00:13:36,886 --> 00:13:37,925
Poena.

147
00:13:39,446 --> 00:13:43,725
Don't let meaningless
thoughts confuse your mind.

148
00:13:46,806 --> 00:13:49,205
What you have been through is not easy.

149
00:13:49,846 --> 00:13:51,085
Besides...

150
00:13:52,766 --> 00:13:56,365
...at such a young age, you
are carrying such a big revenge.

151
00:13:58,286 --> 00:14:00,725
It is normal for you to be tired now.

152
00:14:26,406 --> 00:14:27,445
Drink.

153
00:14:29,366 --> 00:14:30,645
Look, Poena...

154
00:14:31,246 --> 00:14:33,445
Thanks to this lie...

155
00:14:33,566 --> 00:14:37,885
...Osman and Bala will suffer the
grief of losing a child once again.

156
00:14:40,006 --> 00:14:43,565
We will make them pay heavily...

157
00:14:45,126 --> 00:14:47,765
...for the pain they caused you.

158
00:15:01,246 --> 00:15:03,845
Do not forget to take your medicine again.

159
00:15:04,726 --> 00:15:06,245
Drink some more.

160
00:15:14,526 --> 00:15:17,445
Alright. What will happen now, aunt?

161
00:15:21,526 --> 00:15:23,885
Do not worry about this now.

162
00:15:26,726 --> 00:15:29,765
Have some rest. Come on, drink it. Drink it.

163
00:15:41,526 --> 00:15:43,005
When you wake up...

164
00:15:44,206 --> 00:15:46,525
..your pain will be gone.

165
00:16:12,006 --> 00:16:13,285
Halime.

166
00:16:15,366 --> 00:16:18,485
I will not kill you before
making you talk, Sofia.

167
00:16:21,406 --> 00:16:23,405
You will take me to my Halime.

168
00:16:33,326 --> 00:16:34,925
I have to get out of here.

169
00:16:40,536 --> 00:16:42,705
Osman Bey Secret Tents

170
00:16:57,646 --> 00:17:01,885
Osman Bey is coming!
Osman Bey is coming!

171
00:17:09,126 --> 00:17:11,845
Welcome, my Bey.

172
00:17:11,846 --> 00:17:15,585
Father..

173
00:17:18,185 --> 00:17:19,204
Are you alright?

174
00:17:19,286 --> 00:17:22,645
You left without saying
anything after the raid on the tribe.

175
00:17:23,165 --> 00:17:25,845
I am alright, my daughter. Don't worry.

176
00:17:26,205 --> 00:17:28,525
I am alright.

177
00:17:34,446 --> 00:17:37,525
Tell me.
What is the situation?

178
00:17:37,606 --> 00:17:40,525
While we were burying our martyr, Saruca Bey...

179
00:17:43,886 --> 00:17:45,925
We received your order then, my Bey.

180
00:17:46,126 --> 00:17:48,845
We immediately withdrew from Sogut to here.

181
00:17:49,286 --> 00:17:52,254
Shamil and Turhan are leading
one troop of watchmen and

182
00:17:52,266 --> 00:17:55,245
Aykurt and Kanyumaz are
leading the other group, my Bey.

183
00:17:55,326 --> 00:17:57,285
Our precautions are complete.

184
00:18:00,766 --> 00:18:02,085
The enemies..

185
00:18:02,926 --> 00:18:05,045
...are after me and my family.

186
00:18:06,246 --> 00:18:11,205
Staying in Sogut would be more
dangerous for our innocent people.

187
00:18:11,806 --> 00:18:19,045
That's why we will stay here secretly
for a while until we take our tribe.

188
00:18:20,446 --> 00:18:25,485
But no one will reveal themselves or the tribe.

189
00:18:28,126 --> 00:18:29,245
Father...

190
00:18:30,806 --> 00:18:31,885
We were...

191
00:18:33,446 --> 00:18:35,845
...going to bury my mother in the tribe.

192
00:18:37,366 --> 00:18:38,805
But now...

193
00:18:48,526 --> 00:18:50,045
We will, my daughter.

194
00:18:51,166 --> 00:18:52,445
We will.

195
00:18:59,686 --> 00:19:01,125
What is happening to you?

196
00:19:02,806 --> 00:19:05,005
Why do you bow your heads?

197
00:19:06,406 --> 00:19:09,925
Why do you surrender to sorrow? Don't!

198
00:19:10,406 --> 00:19:11,525
Uluga

199
00:19:12,806 --> 00:19:15,645
That dog Ulugan learned about our plan.

200
00:19:16,526 --> 00:19:20,205
We had to return. But do not forget.

201
00:19:20,206 --> 00:19:22,685
We did not give up, we did not fall.

202
00:19:24,526 --> 00:19:28,805
Even if I die, I will never
step back from my oath.

203
00:19:31,646 --> 00:19:33,965
That's why, when the time comes...

204
00:19:35,646 --> 00:19:37,445
...we will take our tribe.

205
00:19:38,726 --> 00:19:40,525
We will take our land.

206
00:19:40,526 --> 00:19:44,005
-God willing. God willing my Bey.
-God willing. God willing my Bey.

207
00:19:44,006 --> 00:19:48,725
But we have never given up
on our oath as well my Bey.

208
00:19:48,806 --> 00:19:53,165
If necessary, we will give our lives.
But we will never give up on your path.

209
00:19:53,686 --> 00:19:57,765
Your oath is our oath, my
Bey. We will take our tribe.

210
00:19:58,286 --> 00:20:01,605
We will bury my mother
next to my sister, God willing.

211
00:20:02,126 --> 00:20:03,365
God willing.

212
00:20:06,166 --> 00:20:08,245
God willing. God willing.

213
00:20:11,526 --> 00:20:13,045
Follow me.

214
00:20:14,966 --> 00:20:16,205
Soldiers!

215
00:20:40,246 --> 00:20:42,245
Welcome Ulugan.

216
00:20:44,046 --> 00:20:46,245
You haven't been seen around lately.

217
00:20:48,606 --> 00:20:50,885
You send me soldiers...

218
00:20:52,046 --> 00:20:54,685
...but do not lead the army.

219
00:20:56,406 --> 00:21:00,365
You go into your den like a fox...

220
00:21:01,526 --> 00:21:03,365
...and stay silent.

221
00:21:03,606 --> 00:21:07,885
And you see yourself above me...

222
00:21:08,686 --> 00:21:10,565
...and do not stand up.

223
00:21:13,286 --> 00:21:15,925
What is your problem, Sofia?

224
00:21:25,446 --> 00:21:28,885
I do not see myself above you, Ulugan.

225
00:21:30,446 --> 00:21:34,085
But you should not see yourself above me either.

226
00:21:40,926 --> 00:21:42,485
Lukas died.

227
00:21:43,926 --> 00:21:47,165
All his power and strength are now mine.

228
00:21:48,926 --> 00:21:50,245
No, mine.

229
00:21:51,126 --> 00:21:55,205
What you call "your property" is only mine.

230
00:21:56,406 --> 00:22:00,165
I gave you the castles Osman took from you.

231
00:22:01,486 --> 00:22:03,125
Where is my gold?

232
00:22:06,886 --> 00:22:11,405
Unlike you, we respect our dead.

233
00:22:11,846 --> 00:22:14,285
When Lukas died, I took care of him.

234
00:22:15,166 --> 00:22:18,565
I will give you your gold.

235
00:22:18,566 --> 00:22:20,685
Of course, you will.

236
00:22:26,606 --> 00:22:29,605
You would not stay behind these cold walls...

237
00:22:30,766 --> 00:22:34,365
...for nothing, Sofia.

238
00:22:36,326 --> 00:22:43,125
While Osman walks freely
outside, you would not hold back.

239
00:22:49,246 --> 00:22:56,925
What are you hiding from me. Red Hatun?

240
00:23:00,046 --> 00:23:01,365
Nothing.

241
00:23:04,486 --> 00:23:06,805
I am just mourning.

242
00:23:15,326 --> 00:23:16,365
Wake up!

243
00:23:18,406 --> 00:23:20,485
You need to eat enough to stay alive.

244
00:23:20,486 --> 00:23:24,765
Master Sofia still has a lot to do
with you. I am talking to you, get up!

245
00:23:26,486 --> 00:23:29,285
Open the door, something is happening.

246
00:23:31,926 --> 00:23:33,125
Hold this.

247
00:23:35,046 --> 00:23:39,045
What is happening? What
is happening? Call a doctor!

248
00:24:00,686 --> 00:24:02,205
Die!

249
00:24:22,206 --> 00:24:24,245
Wait for me, Sofia.

250
00:24:25,206 --> 00:24:27,405
I'm coming.

251
00:24:30,486 --> 00:24:32,685
We all know the situation.

252
00:24:33,246 --> 00:24:37,165
While capturing Sogut and taking the tribe back.

253
00:24:38,006 --> 00:24:40,405
...we lost too many alps.

254
00:24:41,246 --> 00:24:43,645
We lost strength.

255
00:24:44,086 --> 00:24:47,085
But now we should...

256
00:24:47,566 --> 00:24:52,005
...turn the situation into a weapon against
which heathens will get caught unaware.

257
00:24:54,086 --> 00:24:57,405
How will we do that, my Bey?
I mean... What's in your mind?

258
00:24:58,166 --> 00:25:01,045
They think we have fallen weak.

259
00:25:01,406 --> 00:25:05,045
Nobody expects us to attack.

260
00:25:05,486 --> 00:25:09,165
But we will make them know...

261
00:25:09,446 --> 00:25:13,205
...Turks never stop fighting
though their wings are broken.

262
00:25:14,206 --> 00:25:16,925
Let them keep looking for us.

263
00:25:19,446 --> 00:25:20,885
We will..

264
00:25:24,446 --> 00:25:29,165
...raid the biggest Turkmen
tribe under Mongolian authority.

265
00:25:29,396 --> 00:25:32,595
So we will also break Ulugan's
noker(Mongolian soldier) force.

266
00:25:32,645 --> 00:25:33,805
Absolutely.

267
00:25:34,166 --> 00:25:38,685
First, we need to free the people in captivity.

268
00:25:39,166 --> 00:25:43,845
Then we'll take Turkmen
Beys and their alps on our side.

269
00:25:44,526 --> 00:25:48,445
Now it's the best time to gain
power. You're right, my Bey.

270
00:25:52,006 --> 00:25:53,805
My sons.

271
00:25:55,646 --> 00:25:57,325
You two have this duty.

272
00:26:00,006 --> 00:26:02,325
Boran, Cerkutay and Yusuf...

273
00:26:03,366 --> 00:26:05,485
You and I will have another task.

274
00:26:08,446 --> 00:26:12,165
Come on, sons. Get prepared and leave quickly.

275
00:26:16,966 --> 00:26:18,525
Well, my Bey...

276
00:26:19,846 --> 00:26:22,165
What is our task?

277
00:26:22,886 --> 00:26:24,845
Listen to me carefully now.

278
00:26:54,126 --> 00:26:57,285
I'm coming, Sofia. I'm coming.

279
00:28:22,326 --> 00:28:25,645
Soldiers! Escort Ulugan.

280
00:28:30,726 --> 00:28:32,485
Sofia..

281
00:28:59,246 --> 00:29:02,325
Hristo, make sure that Ulugan has left quietly.

282
00:29:02,406 --> 00:29:04,485
He shouldn't know about Bala.

283
00:29:08,206 --> 00:29:09,885
Bala!

284
00:29:14,406 --> 00:29:15,885
Sofia!

285
00:29:18,806 --> 00:29:20,445
Where is my daughter, Sofia?

286
00:29:21,246 --> 00:29:24,365
Soldiers!
Shut up!

287
00:29:24,646 --> 00:29:27,925
You've sent all the soldiers with Ulugan.

288
00:29:28,166 --> 00:29:31,725
You can't beat us even if
all of you get united, Sofia!

289
00:29:31,806 --> 00:29:34,565
You will never behave, right?

290
00:29:34,646 --> 00:29:36,205
You did such a thing to me...

291
00:29:36,206 --> 00:29:40,325
...that the fire inside me will never
die even if you kill me a thousand times!

292
00:29:40,406 --> 00:29:43,445
-Take me to my daughter.
-Never.

293
00:29:43,846 --> 00:29:45,405
I will never do that.

294
00:29:45,446 --> 00:29:47,165
I'll kill you, Sofia.

295
00:29:47,366 --> 00:29:48,645
I will kill you!

296
00:29:48,646 --> 00:29:50,965
You can't do anything, Bala.

297
00:29:51,486 --> 00:29:54,925
If you kill me, you can't find Halime.

298
00:29:55,046 --> 00:29:57,605
Only I know where she is.

299
00:29:57,726 --> 00:29:59,445
I know she's alive.

300
00:29:59,446 --> 00:30:01,205
I'll certainly find my daughter.

301
00:30:01,206 --> 00:30:05,325
But if you don't want to die
you have to take me to her

302
00:30:06,006 --> 00:30:07,485
Get up

303
00:30:07,686 --> 00:30:10,485
Get up! Move!

304
00:30:11,486 --> 00:30:14,965
You'll take me to my daughter, Sofia. Move!

305
00:30:15,526 --> 00:30:19,005
I'll kill you after I find my daughter. Move!

306
00:30:23,926 --> 00:30:25,645
Look at this.

307
00:30:26,806 --> 00:30:28,885
Who is here?

308
00:30:29,646 --> 00:30:31,285
Ulugan.

309
00:30:38,486 --> 00:30:40,885
I thought you were dead, hatun.

310
00:30:41,566 --> 00:30:44,325
Even the fire didn't accept you, huh?

311
00:30:44,646 --> 00:30:46,605
Death comes from Allah, Ulugan.

312
00:30:46,686 --> 00:30:50,525
It seems I still have time to see your death.

313
00:30:50,766 --> 00:30:53,005
Your weak head..

314
00:30:54,406 --> 00:30:57,645
...would fall on the ground
with one move of my sword.

315
00:30:59,446 --> 00:31:03,125
-Bala...
-But no.

316
00:31:03,726 --> 00:31:07,725
You have to see your
impertinent husband's death first.

317
00:31:13,286 --> 00:31:15,045
Nokers(Mongolian soldiers)!

318
00:31:22,206 --> 00:31:25,125
You kept Bala from me, huh?

319
00:31:25,846 --> 00:31:28,845
Begum made a stupid
decision and I made use of it.

320
00:31:30,846 --> 00:31:33,525
I was going to tell you when it was time.

321
00:31:34,646 --> 00:31:38,845
Soldiers, give her clothes to her
before taking her to the dungeon.

322
00:31:58,326 --> 00:32:00,285
Bala..

323
00:32:13,326 --> 00:32:15,525
He's not sharing his plan again.

324
00:32:16,526 --> 00:32:19,925
We're going after a secret, brother.

325
00:32:22,486 --> 00:32:24,565
I'm curious too, brother.

326
00:32:24,966 --> 00:32:27,485
But Beys have secrets, you know.

327
00:32:27,806 --> 00:32:29,125
So keep silent.

328
00:32:29,366 --> 00:32:31,485
Look what you say!

329
00:32:33,486 --> 00:32:35,885
Brother, why is he not trusting us?

330
00:32:36,006 --> 00:32:38,725
What if he even tells us?
Would we say no? Never!

331
00:32:38,806 --> 00:32:42,485
Wouldn't we trust him?
Wouldn't we join his cause?

332
00:32:42,726 --> 00:32:45,325
How can I know, Cerkutay?

333
00:32:45,446 --> 00:32:49,085
We may question if tells us.
Maybe that's why he's not telling.

334
00:32:49,446 --> 00:32:51,165
You know what?

335
00:32:51,246 --> 00:32:54,005
Without knowing the
secret, I will speak no more.

336
00:32:54,246 --> 00:32:58,445
Speak, question or get
curious just for once! But no!

337
00:32:58,446 --> 00:33:02,285
-Don't question your duty just for once.
-What are you talking about?

338
00:33:04,566 --> 00:33:05,965
My Bey..

339
00:33:06,846 --> 00:33:08,365
We have been wondering...

340
00:33:09,046 --> 00:33:12,245
We're getting closer to the tribe, you know.

341
00:33:12,966 --> 00:33:15,045
You didn't explain our duty.

342
00:33:16,206 --> 00:33:18,885
Will we infiltrate the tribe, my Bey?

343
00:33:19,206 --> 00:33:20,805
No.

344
00:33:24,166 --> 00:33:26,885
One of tribe people is coming to meet us.

345
00:33:34,926 --> 00:33:36,525
Your sister.

346
00:33:36,686 --> 00:33:38,925
Send a message to the tribe with alps.

347
00:33:39,206 --> 00:33:42,845
Getting a message from you,
she will definitely come here.

348
00:33:42,926 --> 00:33:46,245
-She will have her punishment later.
-As you order, my Bey.

349
00:33:51,566 --> 00:33:54,325
What? Why are you upset?

350
00:33:56,166 --> 00:33:59,285
Those who made me upset
shall be ashamed, my Bey.

351
00:34:00,046 --> 00:34:02,165
It shouldn't have been like this.

352
00:34:03,366 --> 00:34:04,885
It's your right, though.

353
00:34:05,446 --> 00:34:08,165
It's your true right to avenge Bala Hatun.

354
00:34:10,085 --> 00:34:12,885
Don't be embarrassed. Ever.

355
00:34:13,446 --> 00:34:16,405
You and your sister have different characters.

356
00:34:17,246 --> 00:34:20,405
Well... One is born as a man.

357
00:34:21,806 --> 00:34:24,125
The other is born as a dog.

358
00:34:24,686 --> 00:34:27,605
Yes, my Bey. May Allah be pleased with you.

359
00:34:30,166 --> 00:34:31,925
Don't worry.

360
00:34:32,646 --> 00:34:34,925
I know how to bring her here.

361
00:34:41,766 --> 00:34:43,324
Brother.

362
00:34:43,886 --> 00:34:46,125
You're worried about father, right?

363
00:34:47,806 --> 00:34:50,005
He was acting differently, brother.

364
00:34:51,406 --> 00:34:55,045
He took only Boran Bey,
Cerkutay Bey and Yusuf with him.

365
00:34:56,686 --> 00:34:59,005
They even told them nothing.

366
00:34:59,206 --> 00:35:02,365
The fire Osman Bey will start has no limits now.

367
00:35:02,926 --> 00:35:05,725
We'll find out when it is time.

368
00:35:06,246 --> 00:35:08,605
Let's save those Turkmen villages...

369
00:35:08,966 --> 00:35:11,605
...from the Mongolians dogs first.

370
00:35:12,606 --> 00:35:14,365
Yes, yes.

371
00:35:14,806 --> 00:35:16,885
If they notice us.

372
00:35:17,686 --> 00:35:20,645
...they'll kill women and children first.

373
00:35:21,206 --> 00:35:23,205
We won't let them notice.

374
00:35:24,406 --> 00:35:27,085
We'll take care of the nokers(Mongolian soldiers)
at the gate first.

375
00:35:27,246 --> 00:35:28,725
Then...

376
00:35:29,326 --> 00:35:32,485
...we will jump on them when they never expect!

377
00:35:34,766 --> 00:35:36,685
Samil, Aykurt.

378
00:35:36,806 --> 00:35:38,925
Go ahead and check the situation.

379
00:35:38,966 --> 00:35:40,405
As you order, my Shahzade.

380
00:35:40,406 --> 00:35:43,285
We'll find out their plans.

381
00:35:44,286 --> 00:35:45,445
Alright.

382
00:35:47,446 --> 00:35:50,045
For every life they took,

383
00:35:51,366 --> 00:35:54,085
...we will be hell for them.

384
00:36:08,846 --> 00:36:12,085
Whatever you do, I won't stop.

385
00:36:17,246 --> 00:36:20,845
You'll never be able to
get out of this place, Bala.

386
00:36:22,086 --> 00:36:24,365
Ever.

387
00:36:30,926 --> 00:36:33,045
You'll see, Sofia.

388
00:36:33,606 --> 00:36:38,325
I won't stop until I take
back what you took from me.

389
00:36:40,046 --> 00:36:42,645
Stop dreaming, Bala.

390
00:36:44,166 --> 00:36:46,085
Look at this place!

391
00:36:46,606 --> 00:36:49,765
This will be a grave for Osman and you!

392
00:36:57,086 --> 00:36:58,325
Sofia.

393
00:36:58,846 --> 00:37:00,685
Sofia!

394
00:37:03,966 --> 00:37:06,005
Sofia

395
00:37:15,766 --> 00:37:18,405
You lied to me, girl.

396
00:37:20,846 --> 00:37:22,885
Next time

397
00:37:23,326 --> 00:37:25,205
..I will kill you.

398
00:37:26,966 --> 00:37:30,485
Killing me wouldn't be good for you, Ulugan.

399
00:37:31,406 --> 00:37:33,725
Our enemy is Osman.

400
00:37:34,046 --> 00:37:37,405
And we both want him to die.

401
00:37:43,606 --> 00:37:45,885
I just...

402
00:37:49,966 --> 00:37:52,885
...want him to die suffering.

403
00:37:55,006 --> 00:37:57,285
If you play with the prey,

404
00:37:57,846 --> 00:37:59,805
...you lose the prey.

405
00:38:00,646 --> 00:38:02,605
If you waste time

406
00:38:02,966 --> 00:38:04,365
..you lose it.

407
00:38:05,446 --> 00:38:08,525
I never lose, Ulugan.

408
00:38:10,166 --> 00:38:14,325
I took his heart out.

409
00:38:16,726 --> 00:38:20,005
I won't die before I kill you, Sofia.

410
00:38:20,886 --> 00:38:24,005
I won't die before I kill you!

411
00:38:27,006 --> 00:38:29,805
Send the good news to Osman.

412
00:38:30,606 --> 00:38:32,205
The Hatun is alive.

413
00:38:33,246 --> 00:38:34,725
He can know now.

414
00:38:36,366 --> 00:38:37,645
Osman..

415
00:38:38,486 --> 00:38:41,645
...will come running to his death, Bala.

416
00:38:43,246 --> 00:38:45,605
Your great love...

417
00:38:47,566 --> 00:38:49,965
...will be Osman's death

418
00:38:55,126 --> 00:38:58,965
Sofia! Sofia come here! Sofia, no!

419
00:38:58,966 --> 00:39:01,685
Osman... Osman

420
00:39:02,606 --> 00:39:05,845
Sofia! Osman! Osman, no!

421
00:39:24,086 --> 00:39:25,445
Yusuf...

422
00:39:28,166 --> 00:39:29,525
Brother..

423
00:39:47,646 --> 00:39:51,165
Kayis tried to take their
anger on you through me.

424
00:39:51,686 --> 00:39:54,565
I don't know how long I
can live with this wound.

425
00:39:57,846 --> 00:39:59,765
I am hiding in Saripinar.

426
00:39:59,846 --> 00:40:04,645
Even though you have been on
the wrong way, you are my sister.

427
00:40:11,766 --> 00:40:12,925
Yusuf.

428
00:40:15,766 --> 00:40:21,125
Before I take my last breathy my
last wish is to ask for your pardon.

429
00:40:22,446 --> 00:40:25,365
If you come quickly, you
can find me before I die.

430
00:40:25,366 --> 00:40:27,805
If not, it's alright.

431
00:40:31,366 --> 00:40:34,405
Protect our father's ring.

432
00:40:34,766 --> 00:40:37,885
My pardon is yours.

433
00:40:37,886 --> 00:40:39,525
Your brother, Yusuf.

434
00:40:43,406 --> 00:40:44,965
Yusuf...

435
00:40:46,286 --> 00:40:47,645
Brother..

436
00:40:53,566 --> 00:40:58,085
Not only this ring, you are
also a trust from my father to me.

437
00:41:01,806 --> 00:41:06,525
It s because of me.
won t..

438
00:41:07,086 --> 00:41:08,685
...let this happen.

439
00:41:26,766 --> 00:41:28,085
Begum, what are you doing?

440
00:41:28,086 --> 00:41:31,205
Osman is looking for you
everywhere! Where are you going?

441
00:41:31,206 --> 00:41:34,845
I am going to Yusuf! They tried to
kill him! I'll go and see him! Move!

442
00:41:34,846 --> 00:41:37,653
What if it's Yusuf's plan? Didn't
your brother betray us before?

443
00:41:37,665 --> 00:41:38,605
He betrayed you.

444
00:41:38,606 --> 00:41:41,765
He betrayed Ulugan. Not me.
He wouldn't harm me. I said move.

445
00:41:41,766 --> 00:41:44,365
No, Begum. No. You're not thinking clearly now.

446
00:41:44,366 --> 00:41:47,605
If necessary. I'll protect you better than you
can protect yourself. You can't go anywhere.

447
00:41:47,606 --> 00:41:51,845
-Ilbay, get out of my way.
-You can't go anywhere. -Move! -No, Begum!

448
00:41:52,126 --> 00:41:53,165
Let go.

449
00:41:58,166 --> 00:42:01,445
So you are the key to find Bala, Begum, huh?

450
00:42:02,006 --> 00:42:05,085
Now you will pay for your evilness.

451
00:42:05,086 --> 00:42:07,365
You will tell me everything one by one.

452
00:42:10,766 --> 00:42:17,365
My Bey, this traitor will not
come. I say we sneak into the tribe.

453
00:42:17,366 --> 00:42:21,445
Let's catch this traitor and give
her her punishment. And it'll be over!

454
00:42:22,486 --> 00:42:24,885
He says he'll sneak into the tribe. Oh, well.

455
00:42:26,046 --> 00:42:29,765
Brother, take it slow when sneaking in.

456
00:42:31,006 --> 00:42:35,525
Remember what happened the last
time you tried to sneak in. We all know.

457
00:42:35,886 --> 00:42:39,565
And that place is no longer
our tribe, it's a den of jackals.

458
00:42:39,686 --> 00:42:43,725
It's hard to enter, even
harder to leave, Cerkutay.

459
00:42:45,006 --> 00:42:47,685
Not our tribe, huh?

460
00:42:48,366 --> 00:42:50,405
Did you say those things to me?

461
00:42:52,526 --> 00:42:54,765
When a smart one is looking for a bridge...

462
00:42:55,246 --> 00:42:57,445
..a fool crosses the water.

463
00:42:57,446 --> 00:43:02,365
What did I do? I didn't sit and
wait like you. I crossed the water!

464
00:43:02,526 --> 00:43:04,245
You are insane.

465
00:43:07,126 --> 00:43:10,085
She will come, my Bey. Don't worry.

466
00:43:10,286 --> 00:43:14,125
When she sees my father's ring,
she'll come to see me for the last time.

467
00:43:14,486 --> 00:43:15,885
God willing.

468
00:43:17,086 --> 00:43:19,205
God willing she will come.

469
00:43:20,846 --> 00:43:22,645
To your positions.

470
00:43:26,526 --> 00:43:30,525
How did Bala run away? Are you alright?

471
00:43:31,006 --> 00:43:32,605
I am alright, my little bird.

472
00:43:35,606 --> 00:43:37,365
Today is the big day.

473
00:43:40,366 --> 00:43:42,285
How are you feeling?

474
00:43:42,406 --> 00:43:46,605
The big day?

475
00:43:47,406 --> 00:43:49,685
It is time to take your revenge, Poena.

476
00:43:51,166 --> 00:43:53,765
Today, Osman and Bala are going to die.

477
00:43:54,606 --> 00:43:57,965
You are going to take your
mother's and father's revenge.

478
00:44:01,686 --> 00:44:02,965
You will tell Osman...

479
00:44:04,406 --> 00:44:08,205
...Bala is alive. -How?

480
00:44:09,646 --> 00:44:11,205
Am I going to tell him?

481
00:44:12,166 --> 00:44:15,285
Why would he believe me?
-He is going to believe you.

482
00:44:15,326 --> 00:44:20,125
And since you'll be the one saying
it, he won't suspect that it's a trap.

483
00:44:21,006 --> 00:44:22,845
He'll ask how I know.

484
00:44:24,006 --> 00:44:25,805
I thought of everything.

485
00:44:27,286 --> 00:44:28,405
Now..

486
00:44:29,406 --> 00:44:30,765
...listen to me carefully.

487
00:44:54,726 --> 00:44:55,925
Yusuf!

488
00:44:56,326 --> 00:44:59,165
Yusuf, brother! -Sister!

489
00:44:59,846 --> 00:45:01,965
I am here, get off the horse!

490
00:45:02,086 --> 00:45:03,805
Yusuf, come here, brother!

491
00:45:03,806 --> 00:45:05,525
Show yourself!

492
00:45:18,006 --> 00:45:19,045
You..

493
00:45:19,606 --> 00:45:21,125
...are not injured.

494
00:45:29,966 --> 00:45:31,525
Traitor Begum.

495
00:45:37,086 --> 00:45:39,045
Finally, you are before us.

496
00:45:40,006 --> 00:45:43,725
Now, for the things you did
to my Hatun, to my Bala...

497
00:45:43,726 --> 00:45:46,845
Now you will pay for what you did.

498
00:45:47,286 --> 00:45:51,045
You lured me into a trap although
you knew they'd kill me, Yusuf!

499
00:45:51,046 --> 00:45:52,325
I told you.

500
00:45:52,406 --> 00:45:54,445
I told you not to do this!

501
00:45:55,126 --> 00:45:56,565
You did not listen to me!

502
00:45:56,726 --> 00:45:59,285
Shame on the efforts I put into you.

503
00:46:02,686 --> 00:46:05,685
You deserved to die from the beginning, sister.

504
00:46:09,526 --> 00:46:11,485
You cannot run away.

505
00:46:11,806 --> 00:46:14,325
You will give me answers for the things you did!

506
00:46:35,206 --> 00:46:37,045
Come on.

507
00:46:38,486 --> 00:46:41,295
In the name of Allah, the merciful,
the compassionate.

508
00:46:42,246 --> 00:46:46,125
Come on! Move!

509
00:46:47,766 --> 00:46:50,125
Life was given to your miserable souls...

510
00:46:50,326 --> 00:46:53,085
...for serving the Mongols.

511
00:46:53,686 --> 00:46:58,005
If you don't work, there is no food, only death.

512
00:47:00,966 --> 00:47:04,205
The Righteous!

513
00:47:08,326 --> 00:47:11,763
We will be the nightmare of
those who try to capture the Turks!

514
00:47:11,775 --> 00:47:12,925
Kayis!

515
00:47:12,926 --> 00:47:15,005
Osman's dog!

516
00:47:15,006 --> 00:47:19,845
Those we killed in the tribe didn't
make you give up, huh? Nokers!

517
00:47:19,846 --> 00:47:23,605
Attack! -Attack, brothers!

518
00:47:32,926 --> 00:47:36,605
We will take the women and children
to the back of the tents. Let's go!

519
00:47:36,606 --> 00:47:41,165
We'll move them away from the battle, come on!

520
00:47:42,686 --> 00:47:44,805
Allah is the Greatest!

521
00:47:44,806 --> 00:47:46,285
Osman's dog...

522
00:47:46,886 --> 00:47:49,325
I will tear apart that courage of yours.

523
00:47:49,446 --> 00:47:52,245
I will place your head under my feet.

524
00:47:52,246 --> 00:47:54,617
The sparks of courage
burning like a blazing fire in the

525
00:47:54,629 --> 00:47:56,845
heart of a Turk, have been
passed down from eternity.

526
00:47:56,846 --> 00:48:00,005
And they will continue
burning forever, for sure.

527
00:48:08,406 --> 00:48:11,925
You've come to your death,
but you are still smiling.

528
00:48:12,966 --> 00:48:14,805
What kind of a person are you?

529
00:48:15,246 --> 00:48:19,245
It's not me, you are the
ones going to death. Nokers(Mongolian soldiers)!

530
00:48:30,766 --> 00:48:32,925
You were right Ilbay Bey.

531
00:48:33,566 --> 00:48:37,085
Even siblings can betray each other.

532
00:48:41,206 --> 00:48:45,885
If the devil was here, even he
would be ashamed of what you did.

533
00:48:47,646 --> 00:48:49,445
But don't worry.

534
00:48:50,486 --> 00:48:52,445
I will be your executioner.

535
00:48:52,486 --> 00:48:55,205
Did you think I would
fall for your trick, Osman?

536
00:48:55,206 --> 00:49:00,485
Now, I have the power. Your
punishment is death. Nokers! Attack!

537
00:49:00,766 --> 00:49:02,365
Come at me then!

538
00:49:28,806 --> 00:49:31,685
I know the games you've played. Where is Bala?

539
00:49:31,686 --> 00:49:36,285
You've lost your mind, Osman.
Bala is in hell. I burned her alive.

540
00:49:45,406 --> 00:49:48,965
You brought my sister into
this, Ilbay. You are the reason!

541
00:49:48,966 --> 00:49:52,725
Your sister is on the right path. You
are the one who is on the wrong way.

542
00:49:52,726 --> 00:49:54,805
Join us, Yusuf.

543
00:49:59,966 --> 00:50:02,485
I would die but never leave my Osman Bey.

544
00:50:14,966 --> 00:50:19,965
I know Bala is alive. You did this to
lure me into a trap. Where is Bala?

545
00:50:20,446 --> 00:50:23,085
Bala's pain made you lose your mind.

546
00:50:23,286 --> 00:50:27,205
You are not sane anymore. I said I
burned her, why don't you understand?

547
00:50:37,086 --> 00:50:39,965
My Bey, there are more of these dogs.

548
00:50:47,926 --> 00:50:51,165
Alps, follow me.

549
00:51:24,366 --> 00:51:26,005
Everyone will see.

550
00:51:26,006 --> 00:51:29,605
Whoever is the enemy of the Turks
will find no peace in both worlds.

551
00:51:38,206 --> 00:51:41,125
Come here, my dear. Come, my child.

552
00:51:55,726 --> 00:51:58,925
Don't be afraid, my dear.
Don't be afraid, my child.

553
00:51:58,926 --> 00:52:01,445
Go to the back of the tent.
Don't be afraid, my dear.

554
00:52:09,486 --> 00:52:11,565
Sahin Bey!

555
00:52:15,086 --> 00:52:19,365
Sahin Bey, are you alright?

556
00:52:23,086 --> 00:52:24,245
Are you alright?

557
00:52:25,686 --> 00:52:26,405
Osman Bey...

558
00:52:26,486 --> 00:52:29,605
Osman Bey never leaves
someone in captivity, Sahin Bey.

559
00:52:29,606 --> 00:52:31,005
Sure, Alaeddin Bey!

560
00:52:31,006 --> 00:52:33,845
Come on! Take this sword! Come on!

561
00:52:42,406 --> 00:52:45,405
Ulugan will make you pay for this raid!

562
00:52:45,406 --> 00:52:48,285
Your alps and people will die!

563
00:52:51,406 --> 00:52:55,445
Are you trying to fear the one who
is asking for shahada with death?

564
00:52:55,446 --> 00:52:58,645
Turks are not scared of
anything, except for captivity!

565
00:53:05,966 --> 00:53:08,325
Now... Now I will send you to hell.

566
00:53:08,526 --> 00:53:13,645
But don't worry. Your owner will come soon.

567
00:53:18,246 --> 00:53:19,653
Are you alright Sahin Bey?

568
00:53:19,665 --> 00:53:21,685
Thanks to Allah.
Captivity is over.

569
00:53:21,686 --> 00:53:23,605
Now

570
00:53:23,606 --> 00:53:25,925
...I want revenge, Orhan Bey.

571
00:53:26,566 --> 00:53:27,725
Okay.

572
00:53:27,766 --> 00:53:29,685
That's why we are here.

573
00:53:32,086 --> 00:53:33,925
Okay. Sahin Bey...

574
00:53:34,326 --> 00:53:39,365
Osman Bey knows that every Turk
seeks a solution for the Mongol trouble.

575
00:53:39,366 --> 00:53:42,525
But the solution... "the
solution is obvious" he says.

576
00:53:42,886 --> 00:53:45,725
Osman Bey wants to...

577
00:53:45,726 --> 00:53:48,605
...unite and attack these dastards.

578
00:53:49,926 --> 00:53:51,325
Sahin Bey...

579
00:53:54,006 --> 00:53:57,365
...there will be many axes
waiting to attack a lonely tree.

580
00:53:57,726 --> 00:53:59,165
We say..

581
00:54:00,326 --> 00:54:02,365
...let's be a mighty forest.

582
00:54:03,686 --> 00:54:07,085
What do you say, what is your decision?

583
00:54:12,966 --> 00:54:19,365
We will defend Osman Bey's da'wah with my
valiants until the last drop of our blood...

584
00:54:20,326 --> 00:54:24,645
...and we will be on his side.

585
00:54:28,686 --> 00:54:29,885
Thank you.

586
00:54:30,526 --> 00:54:32,245
Thank you, Sahin Bey.

587
00:54:32,246 --> 00:54:37,445
Once the blessed lineage of Oghuz unites,
even the steepest mountains will become flat.

588
00:54:37,646 --> 00:54:42,965
Now, with this unity, we will destroy
the enemy against us, for sure.

589
00:54:42,966 --> 00:54:44,365
For sure.

590
00:54:47,486 --> 00:54:49,845
-Live long.
-Thank you.

591
00:55:04,686 --> 00:55:09,325
How did we fall into this trap, my Bey?

592
00:55:09,326 --> 00:55:12,245
Why didn't we kill Begum when we first saw her?

593
00:55:12,366 --> 00:55:15,020
If you had allowed me, I
would have shot my arrow

594
00:55:15,032 --> 00:55:17,645
struck her in the heart,
and she would have died.

595
00:55:18,086 --> 00:55:20,965
Do you think I didn't think of these things?

596
00:55:22,166 --> 00:55:24,765
Do you think I didn't consider the traps...

597
00:55:25,446 --> 00:55:29,925
...Ilbay would set for us? Or
the treachery Begum planned?

598
00:55:30,766 --> 00:55:33,925
Forgive me, my Bey, but then
why did we make this plan?

599
00:55:34,766 --> 00:55:36,165
My intention...

600
00:55:38,046 --> 00:55:41,885
...is not just Begum's death.
What is your intention, my Bey?

601
00:55:45,606 --> 00:55:47,405
There's one thing I believe.

602
00:55:50,486 --> 00:55:51,605
Bala.

603
00:55:54,566 --> 00:55:56,525
Bala Hatun might be alive.

604
00:55:57,446 --> 00:56:00,805
What are you saying, my Bey?

605
00:56:03,046 --> 00:56:04,565
My Bey...

606
00:56:05,446 --> 00:56:07,525
I don't want to repeat it but...

607
00:56:07,526 --> 00:56:10,605
But, Bala Hatun burned before our eyes.

608
00:56:13,006 --> 00:56:14,685
Who is that?

609
00:56:17,326 --> 00:56:21,085
Meryem. What are you doing here?

610
00:56:21,166 --> 00:56:23,365
I was looking for you everywhere, my Bey.

611
00:56:23,566 --> 00:56:26,005
I need to give you important news.

612
00:56:26,926 --> 00:56:29,325
What is this important matter?

613
00:56:29,806 --> 00:56:31,845
Bala Hatun is alive, my Bey.

614
00:56:41,726 --> 00:56:43,485
How?

615
00:56:44,326 --> 00:56:46,765
How come?

616
00:56:49,326 --> 00:56:52,885
Girl, are you hearing yourself?

617
00:56:53,206 --> 00:56:54,885
You heard right, my Bey.

618
00:56:55,206 --> 00:56:57,685
Bala Hatun is alive.

619
00:56:58,806 --> 00:57:02,165
-Bala...
What's happening, my Allah?

620
00:57:02,926 --> 00:57:05,165
What kind of test is this?

621
00:57:06,126 --> 00:57:08,765
How is that possible?

622
00:57:08,926 --> 00:57:12,005
Tell me everything from the beginning.

623
00:57:12,246 --> 00:57:16,285
I had lost my dagger which was
a keepsake from my grandmother.

624
00:57:16,726 --> 00:57:21,005
Thinking I must have dropped in
the cabin, I checked and found it there.

625
00:57:21,326 --> 00:57:24,605
Meryem, where did you see Bala Hatun?

626
00:57:26,046 --> 00:57:29,205
I didn't see Bala Hatun. But...

627
00:57:29,726 --> 00:57:31,605
I got lost sometime.

628
00:57:31,966 --> 00:57:34,645
I saw Byzantine soldiers and hid somewhere.

629
00:57:35,006 --> 00:57:39,285
Then I heard them talking. They
said Bala Hatun was alive, my Bey.

630
00:57:40,566 --> 00:57:46,165
My Allah...Thank You. Thank You.

631
00:57:46,566 --> 00:57:52,365
Girl, tell me. Where are they keeping her?

632
00:57:54,646 --> 00:58:00,005
Akhasir... They talked about
a place something like that.

633
00:58:00,006 --> 00:58:03,245
-Akhisar?
-Yes, my Bey. Akhisar.

634
00:58:03,486 --> 00:58:06,485
-They're keeping her there.
-Akhisar, huh?

635
00:58:06,966 --> 00:58:08,365
Akhisar.

636
00:58:08,606 --> 00:58:10,365
If it is Akhisar,

637
00:58:11,286 --> 00:58:14,085
...this is Sofia's doing.

638
00:58:17,086 --> 00:58:19,485
Get on the horses now! Come on!

639
00:58:24,366 --> 00:58:26,085
Near Akhisar

640
00:58:36,006 --> 00:58:38,245
We'll go inside silently.

641
00:58:38,646 --> 00:58:42,885
We'll save Bala and destroy their place.

642
00:58:45,286 --> 00:58:47,005
You go that way.

643
00:58:47,446 --> 00:58:49,365
Cerkutay, you go that way.

644
00:58:49,966 --> 00:58:51,885
As you order, my Bey.

645
00:58:56,766 --> 00:58:58,525
Here we go.

646
00:59:12,646 --> 00:59:14,605
Turks will be just history.

647
00:59:14,726 --> 00:59:18,485
And their freaky tribe smelling
like goats will be a stable!

648
00:59:22,526 --> 00:59:25,365
-That's Osman.
-Yes, Osman.

649
00:59:35,326 --> 00:59:38,765
History can't be written without Turks.

650
00:59:39,286 --> 00:59:42,045
But you people will be wiped out.

651
00:59:47,166 --> 00:59:49,325
Open it.

652
00:59:54,846 --> 00:59:59,285
We need to get out of here before the dawn.

653
01:00:16,086 --> 01:00:18,845
I've dreamed of this for years.

654
01:00:21,006 --> 01:00:22,645
Finally,

655
01:00:23,486 --> 01:00:26,685
...you're really going to die before my eyes.

656
01:00:30,886 --> 01:00:33,165
And the souls of my parents...

657
01:00:34,406 --> 01:00:36,325
...will find peace.

658
01:00:41,326 --> 01:00:44,005
You're a dangerous woman, Sofia.

659
01:00:50,686 --> 01:00:52,725
I get that

660
01:00:59,926 --> 01:01:02,645
If you keep one more thing from me.

661
01:01:03,286 --> 01:01:08,245
If you ignore me and do things on your own

662
01:01:08,806 --> 01:01:12,445
...your pretty face will be wasted, Sofia.

663
01:01:17,686 --> 01:01:20,525
Did you hear me well?

664
01:01:31,406 --> 01:01:34,165
Whatever you are for Mongolians

665
01:01:34,766 --> 01:01:37,245
...I'm the same thing for Byzantine, Ulugan.

666
01:01:38,446 --> 01:01:40,285
I won't do anything against you.

667
01:01:40,646 --> 01:01:43,965
But don't confuse me with the dogs...

668
01:01:45,646 --> 01:01:47,325
...under your command.

669
01:01:54,126 --> 01:01:56,285
Tell me.

670
01:02:00,126 --> 01:02:04,565
How will you make Osman come here?

671
01:02:05,446 --> 01:02:08,205
-What if he doesn't come? -He will.

672
01:02:10,086 --> 01:02:13,725
Because it wasn't me who
told him that Bala is here.

673
01:02:15,766 --> 01:02:18,805
Do you rely on your spy among them?

674
01:02:19,326 --> 01:02:21,165
Not the spy.

675
01:02:22,326 --> 01:02:24,925
I sent Osman a proof.

676
01:02:25,366 --> 01:02:30,445
He has so many stupid men around him...

677
01:02:31,286 --> 01:02:33,925
...that they didn't realize it was from me.

678
01:02:34,766 --> 01:02:36,405
Then...

679
01:02:37,806 --> 01:02:40,765
Pray for your God, Sofia.

680
01:02:41,126 --> 01:02:43,405
Pray that it will happen...

681
01:02:43,606 --> 01:02:45,965
...and Osman will fall into my clutches.

682
01:02:46,046 --> 01:02:47,965
He already did, Ulugan.

683
01:02:50,206 --> 01:02:52,525
He'll be here soon.

684
01:03:14,806 --> 01:03:16,285
Be quiet.

685
01:03:25,566 --> 01:03:28,365
Easy, easy.

686
01:03:46,806 --> 01:03:50,485
-Here is the door leading to the dungeons.
-Stop!

687
01:03:51,806 --> 01:03:53,565
-Who are you?
-Who are they?

688
01:03:53,566 --> 01:03:55,125
There will be noise, my Bey.

689
01:03:55,246 --> 01:03:57,445
My Bey, you go to the dungeons.

690
01:03:57,486 --> 01:03:59,805
More dogs will come. We can hold the door.

691
01:03:59,806 --> 01:04:01,165
Alright.

692
01:04:02,406 --> 01:04:04,485
Come here, you rabid dogs!

693
01:04:04,646 --> 01:04:07,325
We'll paint the walls of
Akhisar with your blood!

694
01:04:29,766 --> 01:04:31,485
I will be your death.

695
01:04:31,726 --> 01:04:34,045
I will bury you in these dungeons!

696
01:04:36,046 --> 01:04:39,085
Osman. Osman

697
01:04:46,326 --> 01:04:49,165
You vile dogs. Bala!

698
01:04:49,846 --> 01:04:53,485
-Bala...
I'm here, Osman.

699
01:04:58,006 --> 01:05:00,045
Come here.

700
01:05:01,566 --> 01:05:03,205
Osman?

701
01:05:05,886 --> 01:05:07,725
Osman!

702
01:05:23,886 --> 01:05:28,245
Osman... Osman

703
01:05:31,206 --> 01:05:35,005
Osman... Osman.
-Bala.

704
01:05:36,326 --> 01:05:39,365
-You're here.
-I am.

705
01:05:39,526 --> 01:05:43,725
-I will never leave you.
-No.

706
01:05:44,046 --> 01:05:47,045
-You never will.
-I will never leave you.

707
01:05:50,006 --> 01:05:53,645
Just wait. Thanks to Allah.

708
01:05:53,766 --> 01:05:55,885
Thanks to Allah.

709
01:05:56,966 --> 01:05:59,285
I'm here for you.

710
01:06:20,686 --> 01:06:22,725
Bala.

711
01:06:25,606 --> 01:06:27,205
Bala.

712
01:06:27,326 --> 01:06:30,125
You're really here.

713
01:06:30,566 --> 01:06:32,485
What did they do to you?

714
01:06:32,726 --> 01:06:36,485
-What did they do? Let me take off these.
-I'm fine.

715
01:06:36,926 --> 01:06:39,405
You're here now. I'm better.

716
01:06:42,366 --> 01:06:44,685
Take off these.

717
01:06:45,046 --> 01:06:50,045
Take these off. Wait. Easy, easy.

718
01:06:50,686 --> 01:06:52,365
Come on.

719
01:07:07,166 --> 01:07:08,565
My Bala.

720
01:07:08,806 --> 01:07:11,085
My beautiful-eyed woman.

721
01:07:13,926 --> 01:07:16,085
I thought...

722
01:07:16,286 --> 01:07:20,965
I thought you were... You were in the cabin.

723
01:07:23,446 --> 01:07:26,125
I saw you in flames.

724
01:07:29,926 --> 01:07:32,925
You know how much they made us suffer?

725
01:07:34,886 --> 01:07:37,645
I thought you got burned.

726
01:07:38,806 --> 01:07:43,125
But thanks to Allah, you are here now.

727
01:07:43,526 --> 01:07:46,445
You're alive now. Are you alright?

728
01:07:46,726 --> 01:07:48,725
I'm fine and alive.

729
01:07:49,446 --> 01:07:51,925
-Thanks to Allah.
-Thanks to Allah.

730
01:07:52,726 --> 01:07:54,485
Thanks to Allah.

731
01:07:55,406 --> 01:07:56,805
Let's go.

732
01:07:57,206 --> 01:08:00,965
-Let's go.
-Osman, I need to tell you something.

733
01:08:01,766 --> 01:08:04,965
Sofia told me such a thing...
-My Bey!

734
01:08:06,126 --> 01:08:08,485
My Bey, my Bey!

735
01:08:10,766 --> 01:08:12,205
Bala Hatun.

736
01:08:13,206 --> 01:08:16,725
-Boran. Cerkutay.
-Bala Hatun.

737
01:08:18,086 --> 01:08:20,205
Thanks to Allah, Bala Hatun.

738
01:08:20,366 --> 01:08:22,165
God willing, you're fine.

739
01:08:22,206 --> 01:08:24,645
Thanks to Allah, I'm good.

740
01:08:25,685 --> 01:08:28,564
Let's go. We need to talk.

741
01:08:39,166 --> 01:08:40,965
My lady.

742
01:08:43,326 --> 01:08:46,524
It happened as you said. Osman came for Bala.

743
01:08:46,805 --> 01:08:48,484
He's about to fall into our trap.

744
01:08:50,526 --> 01:08:53,045
I told you, Ulugan.

745
01:08:58,926 --> 01:09:02,205
It seems you sacrificed many soldiers for Osman.

746
01:09:03,006 --> 01:09:06,404
You can't hunt without a bait.

747
01:09:07,725 --> 01:09:12,325
I'll have avenged all of them
when Osman falls into our clutches.

748
01:09:15,406 --> 01:09:17,925
Very soon.

749
01:09:21,926 --> 01:09:25,925
Osman, listen to me. Sofia...
-Bala...

750
01:09:25,926 --> 01:09:28,883
I have to get you
out of here alive first.

751
01:09:28,895 --> 01:09:29,885
Osman!

752
01:09:35,725 --> 01:09:40,325
Did you think you could
take your wife and run away?

753
01:09:40,486 --> 01:09:44,045
You're coming after us like a
bunch of snakes again, huh?

754
01:09:44,725 --> 01:09:49,165
I won't bury you only here
but deep in hell as well.

755
01:09:49,206 --> 01:09:53,685
You're struggling in vain.
You've come into your own grave.

756
01:09:54,286 --> 01:09:57,885
I see that you can hardly carry your head.

757
01:09:58,086 --> 01:10:02,285
You're fighting with dirty tricks.

758
01:10:02,846 --> 01:10:05,765
Are you not ashamed of this cowardice at all?

759
01:10:05,926 --> 01:10:08,245
Attack!

760
01:10:27,006 --> 01:10:30,245
Come here. Move.

761
01:10:36,646 --> 01:10:38,845
-Sofia.
-Stop.

762
01:10:45,446 --> 01:10:48,965
-Aunt.
You can't kill me, Osman.

763
01:10:49,046 --> 01:10:50,324
Oh no?

764
01:10:50,336 --> 01:10:54,205
Especially your wife
Bala won't let you do that.

765
01:10:55,086 --> 01:10:57,525
Don't kill her, Osman.

766
01:10:58,326 --> 01:11:00,605
Only she knows where our child is.

767
01:11:01,686 --> 01:11:03,725
What are you saying, Bala?

768
01:11:04,686 --> 01:11:05,845
Bala.

769
01:11:06,166 --> 01:11:08,085
What are you saying?

770
01:11:13,366 --> 01:11:15,365
My Bey.

771
01:11:17,606 --> 01:11:20,765
Bala! Bala!

772
01:11:22,286 --> 01:11:26,885
You heard right, Osman. Your daughter Halime...

773
01:11:27,566 --> 01:11:29,525
..is alive.

774
01:11:30,406 --> 01:11:33,405
She's right, Osman.

775
01:11:34,166 --> 01:11:37,765
-How? How?
-Our daughter is alive.

776
01:11:37,926 --> 01:11:41,525
We'll take our daughter
back, Osman. I can feel it.

777
01:11:41,566 --> 01:11:44,005
Our child is alive!
-Hristo!

778
01:11:44,126 --> 01:11:46,565
-Take Bala away.
-Bala!

779
01:11:46,686 --> 01:11:48,765
Osman, we'll take her back.
-My Bey!

780
01:11:48,846 --> 01:11:50,445
Get off!

781
01:12:23,806 --> 01:12:26,125
Meryem, what are you doing here?

782
01:12:26,726 --> 01:12:28,405
Poena.

783
01:12:34,566 --> 01:12:35,845
Meryem.

784
01:12:35,966 --> 01:12:39,245
What is Meryem doing here? Take Meryem out!

785
01:12:39,686 --> 01:12:41,365
Let's go, my Bey.

786
01:12:41,486 --> 01:12:43,230
We need to go.
We're outnumbered.

787
01:12:43,242 --> 01:12:44,245
I won't leave Bala.

788
01:12:44,246 --> 01:12:47,605
My Bey, they can't harm
her before they catch us.

789
01:12:49,326 --> 01:12:54,085
-Boran is in there. Let's go, my Bey.

790
01:12:54,246 --> 01:12:56,365
-Cerkutay.
-They're running off!

791
01:12:56,406 --> 01:12:58,445
Attack!

792
01:13:05,806 --> 01:13:08,765
Dastards! Osman is in there! Leave me!

793
01:13:08,846 --> 01:13:11,925
-Leave me!
-Both you and Osman will die soon.

794
01:13:12,206 --> 01:13:14,805
We'll see who is going to die.

795
01:13:18,246 --> 01:13:19,645
Osman!

796
01:13:29,286 --> 01:13:30,645
Osman!

797
01:13:30,846 --> 01:13:33,965
I'll take your heart out with my teeth.

798
01:13:34,846 --> 01:13:38,645
After I save Bala, I will
butcher you and your people.

799
01:13:39,006 --> 01:13:40,885
Attack!

800
01:13:46,886 --> 01:13:48,645
Put it up!

801
01:13:54,766 --> 01:13:57,605
Osman, hear me!

802
01:13:58,126 --> 01:14:03,725
If you don't come to Sivrihoyuk tomorrow
and declare that you have surrendered.

803
01:14:03,966 --> 01:14:08,805
...you will watch your wife die in that square!

804
01:14:10,086 --> 01:14:12,285
Do you hear me?

805
01:14:26,346 --> 01:14:28,845
Osman Bey Secret Tents

806
01:14:28,846 --> 01:14:31,885
Hatuns and I made rose sherbet.

807
01:14:36,606 --> 01:14:38,645
Thanks.

808
01:14:41,246 --> 01:14:45,325
In the name of Allah, the merciful,
the compassionate.

809
01:14:49,006 --> 01:14:50,645
Do you like it?

810
01:14:51,446 --> 01:14:54,165
It's delicious. Thank you.

811
01:14:54,606 --> 01:14:56,685
Holofira Hatun.

812
01:14:57,166 --> 01:15:00,965
Didn't you promise me that
you wouldn't tire yourself?

813
01:15:01,046 --> 01:15:03,205
I didn't get tired. Don't worry.

814
01:15:04,646 --> 01:15:06,805
Don't be upset, sister.

815
01:15:07,086 --> 01:15:10,245
We are saying that as we care for you.

816
01:15:10,806 --> 01:15:13,365
If Mother Bala were here

817
01:15:25,246 --> 01:15:27,805
..she wouldn't let you do anything.

818
01:15:28,566 --> 01:15:31,365
She wouldn't let you touch anything.

819
01:15:32,086 --> 01:15:33,325
She wouldn't.

820
01:15:37,006 --> 01:15:39,125
My mother isn't here anymore.

821
01:15:40,326 --> 01:15:42,085
She's gone.

822
01:15:53,326 --> 01:15:54,965
My sister.

823
01:15:55,846 --> 01:15:57,445
My pretty-faced sister.

824
01:16:00,806 --> 01:16:06,285
Fatma, our mother isn't dead.

825
01:16:07,566 --> 01:16:13,765
Look. She is living here

826
01:16:16,246 --> 01:16:20,405
She'll be here until we meet in the afterworld.

827
01:16:21,766 --> 01:16:23,685
My pretty sister.

828
01:16:27,886 --> 01:16:32,685
What mother and father liked most
was seeing you all together like this.

829
01:16:33,006 --> 01:16:35,525
Yes, yes.

830
01:16:36,126 --> 01:16:40,405
We will always be together like this.

831
01:16:40,966 --> 01:16:45,445
We'll keep fighting for our
cause beside our father.

832
01:16:48,126 --> 01:16:49,965
That's right.

833
01:16:53,206 --> 01:16:57,285
We haven't got any news from Boran Bey, right?

834
01:16:57,846 --> 01:17:00,205
Nobody has come to the tribe.

835
01:17:00,966 --> 01:17:03,245
Our father must have a plan, Alaaddin.

836
01:17:03,406 --> 01:17:05,765
He'd have told us if we needed to know.

837
01:17:06,246 --> 01:17:09,765
We carried out the duty properly, 
thank Allah.

838
01:17:10,046 --> 01:17:13,405
If we don't get any news till the morning

839
01:17:14,006 --> 01:17:17,325
...we will go after them, brother.

840
01:17:17,886 --> 01:17:19,325
Alright, brother.

841
01:17:32,646 --> 01:17:36,765
My Bey, before we entered the dungeon tunnels,

842
01:17:37,566 --> 01:17:39,845
...those heathens noticed us.

843
01:17:39,886 --> 01:17:44,485
Did we make a mistake or get
caught unaware? How did that happen?

844
01:17:44,686 --> 01:17:49,845
My Bey, what if that red demon's words are true?

845
01:17:53,286 --> 01:17:55,285
They're making use of our grief.

846
01:17:55,526 --> 01:17:59,325
They're playing with our minds and hearts.

847
01:18:00,046 --> 01:18:01,445
Then..

848
01:18:02,566 --> 01:18:05,565
We should save Bala
Hatun before Sivrihoyuk, huh?

849
01:18:05,806 --> 01:18:07,085
We will.

850
01:18:07,126 --> 01:18:08,805
Of course, we will.

851
01:18:08,926 --> 01:18:14,205
After Boran watches those
heathens and locates Bala,

852
01:18:14,486 --> 01:18:16,965
...we will make a plan accordingly.

853
01:18:18,606 --> 01:18:20,045
My Bey.

854
01:18:21,006 --> 01:18:22,605
You're bleeding.

855
01:18:23,486 --> 01:18:26,165
You got wounded while protecting me.

856
01:18:26,326 --> 01:18:28,405
Let me bandage it.

857
01:18:30,926 --> 01:18:34,245
Here, girl. Take this.

858
01:18:36,326 --> 01:18:37,565
Take this.

859
01:18:37,726 --> 01:18:41,165
Bandage it with this napkin as red as my blood.

860
01:18:44,046 --> 01:18:46,685
Nothing else would cure me.

861
01:18:56,086 --> 01:18:57,925
My Bey.

862
01:18:59,086 --> 01:19:01,085
We should also cauterize it.

863
01:19:07,046 --> 01:19:11,245
What happened to your great trick, Sofia?

864
01:19:12,966 --> 01:19:16,525
Osman was just in our clutches.

865
01:19:16,806 --> 01:19:20,605
But your foolish soldiers let him escape.

866
01:19:24,446 --> 01:19:26,525
That was his last escape.

867
01:19:27,566 --> 01:19:30,925
Yet he won't stop.

868
01:19:35,086 --> 01:19:36,245
Bala.

869
01:19:37,806 --> 01:19:40,405
She was talking about someone named Halime.

870
01:19:42,166 --> 01:19:43,205
Who is she?

871
01:19:48,166 --> 01:19:50,005
I told stupid Bala...

872
01:19:50,406 --> 01:19:53,445
...that her dead daughter was alive.

873
01:19:54,726 --> 01:19:58,485
So she will die a thousand
times before she actually dies.

874
01:20:00,646 --> 01:20:02,405
She believed it.

875
01:20:07,966 --> 01:20:09,565
You keep...

876
01:20:09,766 --> 01:20:12,605
...playing games. Red Hatun.

877
01:20:13,606 --> 01:20:15,405
But Osman..

878
01:20:15,726 --> 01:20:18,765
...will come here with a bigger game.

879
01:20:19,606 --> 01:20:22,205
He will try sneaking in again for sure.

880
01:20:22,206 --> 01:20:24,765
But he will never be able to find her.

881
01:20:33,246 --> 01:20:36,405
I will take Bala to my secret temple.

882
01:20:37,486 --> 01:20:42,205
Osman doesn't even know such a place exists.

883
01:20:47,086 --> 01:20:52,085
I will not tolerate a single mistake. Red Hatun.

884
01:20:52,726 --> 01:20:55,325
I want Osman to die as soon as possible.

885
01:21:01,966 --> 01:21:05,765
Osman and Bala will die in pain!

886
01:21:10,406 --> 01:21:16,605
And this will happen thanks to me. Know that.

887
01:21:38,006 --> 01:21:39,725
Soldiers, get ready.

888
01:21:39,766 --> 01:21:41,445
We will secretly take her away.

889
01:21:42,966 --> 01:21:44,645
Will they take Bala Hatun away?

890
01:21:46,806 --> 01:21:49,125
Osman's spies might be around!

891
01:21:49,126 --> 01:21:51,005
Everyone will be on alert!

892
01:21:51,006 --> 01:21:53,725
No one will stop until we arrive in the temple!

893
01:22:04,926 --> 01:22:07,445
They will take Bala Hatun to the temple.

894
01:22:07,686 --> 01:22:10,125
Dastard dogs...

895
01:22:10,446 --> 01:22:11,965
I have to go to my Bey!

896
01:22:12,326 --> 01:22:14,685
Come on..

897
01:22:29,846 --> 01:22:32,605
Bala. Bala.

898
01:22:36,366 --> 01:22:39,885
Are you thinking about
Osman and worrying about him?

899
01:22:49,366 --> 01:22:50,405
No.

900
01:22:50,926 --> 01:22:56,045
I was thinking of how I would kill you
once I get rid of these chains, coward.

901
01:22:58,686 --> 01:23:03,405
Once you get rid of these
chains, you'll die with Osman.

902
01:23:07,166 --> 01:23:11,165
You are used to staying in
those small tents in your little tribe.

903
01:23:11,806 --> 01:23:14,085
The air here hasn't been good for you.

904
01:23:14,406 --> 01:23:16,565
That little mind of yours is clouded.

905
01:23:17,566 --> 01:23:20,365
Soldiers! Prepare Bala Hatun!

906
01:23:21,446 --> 01:23:23,525
Let's take her out for a little walk.

907
01:23:26,046 --> 01:23:27,845
Where will you take me?

908
01:23:28,206 --> 01:23:32,445
To the place where you will wake up
from your dreams and face the reality.

909
01:23:32,526 --> 01:23:34,925
We are going to Sofia's secret temple.

910
01:23:35,446 --> 01:23:37,645
We destroyed Sofia's temple.

911
01:23:38,646 --> 01:23:41,125
Do not underestimate Master Sofia, Bala.

912
01:23:41,126 --> 01:23:43,045
We are going to the secret temple.

913
01:23:43,046 --> 01:23:44,885
No one knows where it is.

914
01:23:45,566 --> 01:23:46,765
Good.

915
01:23:49,366 --> 01:23:51,925
We will destroy that place as well then.

916
01:24:02,086 --> 01:24:04,085
l am sorry, my Bey.

917
01:24:04,326 --> 01:24:06,645
You are wounded because of me.

918
01:24:06,646 --> 01:24:09,325
Being wounded is not important.

919
01:24:09,646 --> 01:24:11,765
You are alright, that's what matters.

920
01:24:13,446 --> 01:24:17,805
You saved my life for many times.
-No.

921
01:24:18,166 --> 01:24:21,805
You treated my wounds. That's enough.

922
01:24:25,126 --> 01:24:26,605
My Meryem daughter...

923
01:24:27,446 --> 01:24:30,885
Why did you come after
us? You put your own life...

924
01:24:30,886 --> 01:24:34,565
...and our lives at risk.

925
01:24:36,966 --> 01:24:39,125
-I...
-You?

926
01:24:39,846 --> 01:24:41,165
Cerkutay.

927
01:24:47,046 --> 01:24:49,365
I felt guilty.

928
01:24:49,726 --> 01:24:51,005
Bala Hatun..

929
01:24:51,246 --> 01:24:53,765
...was abducted because I left to collect herbs.

930
01:24:55,646 --> 01:24:57,805
And I couldn't do anything.

931
01:24:58,206 --> 01:25:00,285
I came after you...

932
01:25:00,286 --> 01:25:03,685
...to help you. -She is brave.

933
01:25:05,726 --> 01:25:07,125
Brave, right.

934
01:25:09,126 --> 01:25:11,005
Maybe that's why we love her.

935
01:25:12,206 --> 01:25:14,005
Maybe that's why we...

936
01:25:16,486 --> 01:25:18,405
..saw her as one of us.

937
01:25:21,606 --> 01:25:22,725
Now...

938
01:25:23,846 --> 01:25:28,285
...how are you going to save Bala
Hatun from that castle, my Bey?

939
01:25:31,366 --> 01:25:32,405
My Bey...

940
01:25:32,806 --> 01:25:34,205
Boran Bey is here.

941
01:25:34,646 --> 01:25:36,325
-Boran!
-Peace be upon you.

942
01:25:36,966 --> 01:25:39,645
Where are they keeping Bala? Is there any news?

943
01:25:39,646 --> 01:25:42,285
Bala Hatun is not in the castle, my Bey.

944
01:25:42,686 --> 01:25:44,645
They took her to a temple.

945
01:25:44,846 --> 01:25:47,365
I wanted to go after them and follow them but...

946
01:25:47,606 --> 01:25:50,845
...they were gone when I left the castle.

947
01:25:51,446 --> 01:25:54,659
So fear has surrounded
the walls of the castle as well.

948
01:25:54,671 --> 01:25:56,085
What else did you hear?

949
01:25:56,646 --> 01:26:00,365
My Bey, Bala Hatun will stay at
the temple she was taken to tonight.

950
01:26:00,526 --> 01:26:04,205
Then they will go to the square
where Ulugan called you, my Bey.

951
01:26:04,246 --> 01:26:09,205
The most vicious dogs of this
Sofia snake will also be there.

952
01:26:09,806 --> 01:26:13,125
In the other temple, they also
have as many men, my Bey.

953
01:26:13,926 --> 01:26:15,525
-Yusuf.
-My Bey.

954
01:26:15,526 --> 01:26:18,965
You will go to Orhan and Alaeddin. They...

955
01:26:19,166 --> 01:26:22,485
...must have freed the
Alps held captive in the tribe.

956
01:26:23,046 --> 01:26:26,365
Since we are entering the war, then...

957
01:26:26,366 --> 01:26:29,885
...we need valiants, we need men.
-Yes my Bey.

958
01:26:29,886 --> 01:26:31,045
Don't...

959
01:26:32,046 --> 01:26:33,805
Don't tell Shahzades...

960
01:26:33,886 --> 01:26:36,125
...that Bala Hatun is alive.

961
01:26:36,486 --> 01:26:39,685
I will tell them everything.
-As you order.

962
01:26:47,006 --> 01:26:48,605
My Allah..

963
01:26:48,606 --> 01:26:51,325
Osman Bey Secret Tents

964
01:26:51,326 --> 01:26:54,765
...forgive my mother' sins, my Allah...

965
01:26:57,726 --> 01:27:00,565
May You make her a
neighbor to our dear Prophet.

966
01:27:17,046 --> 01:27:18,205
My Bey...

967
01:27:31,206 --> 01:27:32,845
May Allah accept it.

968
01:27:35,766 --> 01:27:37,485
Thank you Hatun.

969
01:27:37,726 --> 01:27:41,685
Thank you. -My Alaeddin...

970
01:27:43,446 --> 01:27:45,885
Seeing the pain in your heart...

971
01:27:48,766 --> 01:27:51,445
..and not being able to ease it hurts me.

972
01:27:59,606 --> 01:28:05,045
My mother has been
my most difficult test.

973
01:28:05,206 --> 01:28:07,045
After my Halime...

974
01:28:09,846 --> 01:28:11,285
...I was always afraid.

975
01:28:14,966 --> 01:28:16,165
Every night...

976
01:28:19,246 --> 01:28:25,685
Every night, I slept with the fear that my
mother might not wake up in the morning.

977
01:28:32,806 --> 01:28:34,125
Test..

978
01:28:35,926 --> 01:28:37,165
People...

979
01:28:38,606 --> 01:28:42,205
...are tested in this world with
the ones they love the most...

980
01:28:43,486 --> 01:28:46,525
...and with the things they want the most...

981
01:28:47,446 --> 01:28:49,005
Right...

982
01:28:56,926 --> 01:29:00,125
We will get over this together again, my rose.

983
01:29:08,446 --> 01:29:13,285
When time comes, we will
come together with my mother...

984
01:29:14,446 --> 01:29:15,685
...my sister...

985
01:29:19,606 --> 01:29:21,565
...and our daughter.

986
01:29:23,366 --> 01:29:25,445
We will.

987
01:29:27,406 --> 01:29:29,005
Come here.

988
01:29:39,046 --> 01:29:40,805
What is this Gonca?

989
01:29:45,646 --> 01:29:47,245
It belongs to Meryem.

990
01:29:47,246 --> 01:29:50,085
I was going to give it to
Fatma, but I could not find her.

991
01:29:50,206 --> 01:29:51,965
I'll keep it here for now...

992
01:29:51,966 --> 01:29:54,405
...I will give it to her when I see her.

993
01:29:54,846 --> 01:29:57,365
Meryem... has not returned yet, right?

994
01:29:57,366 --> 01:30:01,485
I asked the Alps, Alaeddin.
But no one has seen her.

995
01:30:04,646 --> 01:30:06,205
Let me put this somewhere.

996
01:30:21,486 --> 01:30:28,085
My Bey, why didn't you tell the
Shahzades that Bala Hatun is alive?

997
01:30:30,686 --> 01:30:33,205
I couldn't have told them without being sure.

998
01:30:34,846 --> 01:30:40,205
I cannot stand seeing them upset
again after giving them the good news.

999
01:30:41,646 --> 01:30:46,165
Bala Hatun is my matter.

1000
01:30:47,886 --> 01:30:52,925
But the state... There is
no emotion in the state.

1001
01:30:53,526 --> 01:30:56,645
Stability is essential in the state.

1002
01:30:57,846 --> 01:31:03,085
I sent Orhan and Alaeddin to Turkmen tribes.

1003
01:31:03,406 --> 01:31:08,085
I want everyone to see that our
struggle for existence continues.

1004
01:31:09,286 --> 01:31:10,805
Okay my Bey.

1005
01:31:11,446 --> 01:31:15,325
Whatever you do, you always do what's right.

1006
01:31:15,366 --> 01:31:17,045
Thank you.

1007
01:31:24,126 --> 01:31:27,925
Father..

1008
01:31:28,846 --> 01:31:30,605
Father..

1009
01:31:31,886 --> 01:31:34,423
She is having a dream, my Bey.
Let me give her some water.

1010
01:31:34,435 --> 01:31:35,285
No.

1011
01:31:38,246 --> 01:31:39,405
Don't.

1012
01:31:42,326 --> 01:31:45,085
Let her at least see her father in her dreams.

1013
01:31:49,246 --> 01:31:51,725
Fate has not shown her...

1014
01:31:52,646 --> 01:31:54,885
...either her mother or her father.

1015
01:31:55,206 --> 01:31:56,585
Let her.

1016
01:32:00,526 --> 01:32:04,005
-But she has a strong heart, my Bey.
-Yes.

1017
01:32:04,446 --> 01:32:05,805
Yes, she does.

1018
01:32:06,926 --> 01:32:09,565
There are not many like her at her age.

1019
01:32:30,606 --> 01:32:33,205
I brought you to your daughter, Bala.

1020
01:32:33,686 --> 01:32:34,965
My Halime..

1021
01:32:35,766 --> 01:32:36,845
My daughter...

1022
01:32:41,886 --> 01:32:42,925
Look..

1023
01:32:45,126 --> 01:32:46,525
Look at this place.

1024
01:32:48,326 --> 01:32:49,445
How does it feel?

1025
01:32:50,166 --> 01:32:51,805
Can you feel it?

1026
01:32:56,126 --> 01:32:57,845
They say mothers can feel it.

1027
01:32:59,166 --> 01:33:01,845
Your daughter grew up here.

1028
01:33:02,086 --> 01:33:03,965
She lived here for five years.

1029
01:33:10,366 --> 01:33:16,325
She stayed in all the temples with me.

1030
01:33:17,846 --> 01:33:19,845
She is different than you...

1031
01:33:20,686 --> 01:33:22,165
..and Osman.

1032
01:33:23,126 --> 01:33:25,485
She is like me, Bala.

1033
01:33:28,246 --> 01:33:29,845
She is a good Christian.

1034
01:33:33,366 --> 01:33:35,925
I will drown you in your own poison, Sofia.

1035
01:33:38,046 --> 01:33:39,125
Look.

1036
01:33:41,606 --> 01:33:42,925
This corner..

1037
01:33:44,206 --> 01:33:45,645
Right there...

1038
01:33:47,046 --> 01:33:49,325
She cried there for days.

1039
01:33:49,326 --> 01:33:52,485
She waited for her father,
she asked for her mother.

1040
01:33:53,486 --> 01:33:55,165
But you did not come, Bala.

1041
01:33:59,046 --> 01:34:03,565
Mother, father... where are you?

1042
01:34:24,126 --> 01:34:25,165
Halime.

1043
01:34:27,166 --> 01:34:28,365
Then..

1044
01:34:29,846 --> 01:34:31,565
...since you did not come...

1045
01:34:32,526 --> 01:34:34,085
...she held on to me.

1046
01:34:44,806 --> 01:34:47,565
She asked me to tell her tales.

1047
01:34:52,846 --> 01:34:53,965
What was it?

1048
01:34:58,486 --> 01:35:01,885
The little gazelle...

1049
01:35:03,446 --> 01:35:07,245
...in the forest...

1050
01:35:21,206 --> 01:35:22,245
Here.

1051
01:35:28,406 --> 01:35:29,725
Smell it.

1052
01:35:34,486 --> 01:35:37,005
I am not telling you a tale.

1053
01:35:38,966 --> 01:35:43,845
I am the truth itself.

1054
01:35:46,606 --> 01:35:47,645
Look..

1055
01:35:49,046 --> 01:35:50,405
It's her doll.

1056
01:36:01,486 --> 01:36:03,485
She always kept this with her.

1057
01:36:34,246 --> 01:36:36,525
Do not forget my favor, Bala.

1058
01:36:37,006 --> 01:36:40,405
Spend enough time with
her belongings before you die.

1059
01:36:42,446 --> 01:36:43,685
Sofia.

1060
01:36:44,686 --> 01:36:45,885
Sofia.

1061
01:36:46,006 --> 01:36:47,845
Sofia, where is my daughter?

1062
01:36:48,726 --> 01:36:50,085
Open the door!

1063
01:36:51,086 --> 01:36:52,405
Where is my daughter?

1064
01:36:52,406 --> 01:36:54,605
Where is my daughter, Sofia?!

1065
01:36:55,006 --> 01:36:57,085
She is not your daughter, Bala.

1066
01:36:59,566 --> 01:37:01,245
She is my daughter.

1067
01:37:02,126 --> 01:37:03,925
No! No! Sofia! No!

1068
01:37:03,926 --> 01:37:05,765
Open the door!

1069
01:37:05,766 --> 01:37:09,005
She is my daughter, Sofia!
Open the door! She is not yours!

1070
01:37:09,446 --> 01:37:11,245
Open the door!

1071
01:37:11,246 --> 01:37:15,325
Sofia!

1072
01:37:15,326 --> 01:37:17,565
She is my daughter...

1073
01:37:40,326 --> 01:37:42,325
Were you afraid, my daughter?

1074
01:37:45,806 --> 01:37:48,645
If I had known, wouldn't I have come, my dear?

1075
01:37:50,006 --> 01:37:52,845
Wouldn't your mother have come?

1076
01:37:56,766 --> 01:37:59,445
Don't be afraid.

1077
01:37:59,446 --> 01:38:03,205
Don't be afraid, my daughter. Don't be afraid.

1078
01:38:06,966 --> 01:38:08,445
Don't be afraid, my daughter.

1079
01:38:17,086 --> 01:38:18,965
I am here.

1080
01:38:19,286 --> 01:38:20,805
I am here Halime.

1081
01:38:21,646 --> 01:38:23,085
I am here.

1082
01:38:31,806 --> 01:38:34,685
My Bey, Shahzades are coming.

1083
01:38:35,006 --> 01:38:37,685
Let them come. Let them.

1084
01:38:45,366 --> 01:38:47,605
-Peace be upon you.
-Peace be upon you, my Bey.

1085
01:38:47,606 --> 01:38:49,525
Peace be upon you too, sons.

1086
01:38:49,526 --> 01:38:51,285
Finally you are here.

1087
01:38:51,646 --> 01:38:52,685
My Bey...

1088
01:38:52,886 --> 01:38:55,285
We raided the Turkmen tribe as you ordered.

1089
01:38:55,286 --> 01:38:59,085
We gained the support of their Beys
and gathered their Alps behind us.

1090
01:38:59,086 --> 01:39:01,285
Now, they wait for your order in the forest.

1091
01:39:01,286 --> 01:39:03,245
Thank you, sons, thank you.

1092
01:39:04,446 --> 01:39:05,645
Meryem.

1093
01:39:07,286 --> 01:39:09,045
What is Meryem doing here, my Bey?

1094
01:39:11,766 --> 01:39:12,925
Meryem.

1095
01:39:13,326 --> 01:39:15,805
Come on my daughter, you helped us enough.

1096
01:39:15,886 --> 01:39:19,005
I did not send you away
because it was dark outside. Now...

1097
01:39:19,446 --> 01:39:23,005
...now go to Fatma as soon as possible.

1098
01:39:24,206 --> 01:39:25,365
Yusuf. -My Bey.

1099
01:39:26,446 --> 01:39:29,165
They will take her there safely.
-As you order my Bey.

1100
01:39:29,166 --> 01:39:30,445
Come, sister.

1101
01:39:36,446 --> 01:39:37,765
Brother...

1102
01:39:43,446 --> 01:39:44,685
Children..

1103
01:39:45,686 --> 01:39:47,485
Come, sit.

1104
01:39:58,206 --> 01:40:01,045
In the name of Allah, the merciful,
the compassionate.

1105
01:40:05,926 --> 01:40:07,005
Father...

1106
01:40:09,606 --> 01:40:12,845
You have also warned Yusuf not to speak.

1107
01:40:14,126 --> 01:40:16,085
What are you doing here, my Bey?

1108
01:40:16,926 --> 01:40:18,645
We are close to Akhisar, my Bey.

1109
01:40:19,006 --> 01:40:23,245
Is your intention to gather the Turkmen
Alps behind us and surround the castle?

1110
01:40:24,486 --> 01:40:25,925
But no...

1111
01:40:26,806 --> 01:40:28,965
We are not strong enough for now.

1112
01:40:32,086 --> 01:40:33,285
Bala Hatun.

1113
01:40:37,566 --> 01:40:39,125
Bala Hatun is alive.

1114
01:40:41,966 --> 01:40:43,365
What?

1115
01:40:46,766 --> 01:40:48,005
Father?

1116
01:40:52,046 --> 01:40:53,565
My mother is alive, huh?

1117
01:40:53,606 --> 01:40:57,645
My Bey, what are you saying -Children...

1118
01:40:58,006 --> 01:40:59,605
She is alive.

1119
01:40:59,606 --> 01:41:04,005
My Bey, what are you saying? -She is alive.

1120
01:41:04,006 --> 01:41:10,485
My Allah.. My Allah... Thanks to You!

1121
01:41:10,486 --> 01:41:12,685
Thanks to You, my Allah.

1122
01:41:12,686 --> 01:41:14,165
Thanks to Allah...

1123
01:41:14,166 --> 01:41:16,045
Your mother is alive, children.

1124
01:41:16,366 --> 01:41:17,925
That snake, Sofia..

1125
01:41:18,406 --> 01:41:19,565
...abducted your mother..

1126
01:41:20,606 --> 01:41:24,405
...from that cabin. -My Allah.

1127
01:41:25,446 --> 01:41:26,394
My brother..

1128
01:41:26,406 --> 01:41:29,285
My mother is alive, brother!
My mother is alive, brother!

1129
01:41:29,286 --> 01:41:30,464
Brother!

1130
01:41:30,476 --> 01:41:34,045
My mother is alive,
brother! She is alive, brother!

1131
01:41:34,606 --> 01:41:36,685
My mother is alive!

1132
01:41:36,686 --> 01:41:37,694
Brother...

1133
01:41:37,706 --> 01:41:40,765
We did not lose our mother, we
still have her and her support, brother!

1134
01:41:40,766 --> 01:41:43,605
Thanks to Allah, brother.

1135
01:41:43,606 --> 01:41:49,245
Thanks to Allah. My Allah, thanks to You...

1136
01:41:51,326 --> 01:41:54,045
Children.

1137
01:41:57,486 --> 01:41:59,965
This whole struggle...

1138
01:42:00,806 --> 01:42:03,845
This whole struggle is to take your mother back.

1139
01:42:08,326 --> 01:42:10,285
But don't worry.

1140
01:42:10,446 --> 01:42:12,525
We will take our land back.

1141
01:42:12,806 --> 01:42:14,805
We will take Bala back.

1142
01:42:14,806 --> 01:42:18,925
We will take everything they took from us.

1143
01:42:18,926 --> 01:42:23,525
We will make them live through the torment of
hell while they are still alive. Don't worry.

1144
01:42:41,846 --> 01:42:44,125
Tell me where the tribe is. I can go myself.

1145
01:42:44,766 --> 01:42:47,285
You shouldn't leave Osman Bey alone.

1146
01:42:47,446 --> 01:42:50,125
Osman Bey gave strict orders, Meryem.

1147
01:42:54,966 --> 01:42:56,365
Jackals!

1148
01:42:56,606 --> 01:42:58,485
Meryem, run for your life!

1149
01:43:31,566 --> 01:43:33,565
Halime.

1150
01:43:44,926 --> 01:43:47,325
I promise I will find you, my daughter.

1151
01:43:49,326 --> 01:43:52,285
And I will make them pay..

1152
01:43:52,806 --> 01:43:55,285
...for the suffering they gave you.

1153
01:44:07,886 --> 01:44:09,965
Did you sleep well, Bala?

1154
01:44:11,486 --> 01:44:13,005
Sofia.

1155
01:44:13,646 --> 01:44:15,765
You're testing my patience.

1156
01:44:16,406 --> 01:44:18,645
Don't worry. There won't be another test.

1157
01:44:19,846 --> 01:44:21,685
We're leaving shortly.

1158
01:44:33,566 --> 01:44:35,925
Where is my daughter, Sofia?

1159
01:44:37,246 --> 01:44:40,645
You'll die before you meet your daughter, Bala.

1160
01:44:42,126 --> 01:44:43,885
Both you and Osman will.

1161
01:44:44,526 --> 01:44:47,205
You'll die today.

1162
01:45:02,086 --> 01:45:05,045
My Bey, we've located the temple.

1163
01:45:05,326 --> 01:45:07,725
We left some alps there.

1164
01:45:07,886 --> 01:45:09,605
They'll be watching.

1165
01:45:10,046 --> 01:45:12,085
There are too many soldiers, my Bey.

1166
01:45:12,246 --> 01:45:15,605
Both nokers(Mongolian soldiers) and Byzantine
soldiers. It's like a fortress, my Bey.

1167
01:45:16,166 --> 01:45:18,245
It has a strong gate.

1168
01:45:19,446 --> 01:45:24,565
One of us is equal to a
thousand of them, thank Allah.

1169
01:45:28,646 --> 01:45:30,645
Listen to me carefully.

1170
01:45:30,926 --> 01:45:33,005
We will split up.

1171
01:45:33,286 --> 01:45:35,645
One wing will attack the front side.

1172
01:45:35,846 --> 01:45:39,765
And the rest will get around
the back of the temple.

1173
01:45:40,046 --> 01:45:44,685
-Alaaddin, this duty is yours.
-As you order, my Bey.

1174
01:45:45,166 --> 01:45:48,925
I'll get beyond the walls with hooked
ropes and get in the back, my Bey.

1175
01:45:49,166 --> 01:45:51,285
Okay, okay. 
Orhan!

1176
01:45:51,486 --> 01:45:56,685
You and alps will attack the front with me.

1177
01:45:57,246 --> 01:46:00,245
-Prepare the shields.
-As you order, my Bey.

1178
01:46:00,846 --> 01:46:04,965
My Bey, Ayaz says there is a hard gate.
We have no rams. How will we make it?

1179
01:46:06,006 --> 01:46:09,045
We will. We will, Aykurt.

1180
01:46:11,326 --> 01:46:15,245
First, we will destroy the temple.

1181
01:46:15,966 --> 01:46:17,885
Then, we'll save Bala.

1182
01:46:18,126 --> 01:46:22,565
And then, God willing, we will
take back our tribe from them.

1183
01:46:22,926 --> 01:46:25,165
-God willing, my Bey.
-God willing.

1184
01:46:25,486 --> 01:46:28,885
May your swords be sharp! Get on the horses now.

1185
01:46:31,486 --> 01:46:33,285
What did you do to her?

1186
01:46:33,606 --> 01:46:35,325
Where is my child?

1187
01:46:35,446 --> 01:46:37,205
You will pay for this!

1188
01:46:38,406 --> 01:46:42,125
It's Osman and you who will pay.

1189
01:46:44,526 --> 01:46:47,885
You'll be punished for everything you did to me.

1190
01:46:48,086 --> 01:46:50,285
And in pain

1191
01:46:51,686 --> 01:46:54,245
...you will beg me.

1192
01:46:57,286 --> 01:46:58,885
Soldiers.

1193
01:47:00,926 --> 01:47:03,405
Get the carriages prepared now!

1194
01:47:04,926 --> 01:47:07,445
Time of pain is coming.

1195
01:47:08,566 --> 01:47:10,525
My lady, Osman

1196
01:47:11,366 --> 01:47:13,805
Our watchmen have seen Osman around.

1197
01:47:14,526 --> 01:47:16,485
Damn it.

1198
01:47:17,206 --> 01:47:18,605
My Osman.

1199
01:47:22,126 --> 01:47:24,165
Don't have false hopes, Bala.

1200
01:47:24,566 --> 01:47:28,085
Osman is coming to his
death. It's fate, you know.

1201
01:47:29,206 --> 01:47:32,045
In the place where I raised your daughter

1202
01:47:32,366 --> 01:47:35,165
..I will make you two bleed...

1203
01:47:35,486 --> 01:47:39,565
...and hang your corpses on the temple gate!

1204
01:47:40,326 --> 01:47:43,485
I swear we will make you regret, Sofia.

1205
01:47:43,846 --> 01:47:46,405
We will never give up.

1206
01:47:47,646 --> 01:47:49,925
You lose, Sofia.

1207
01:47:51,686 --> 01:47:53,885
You lose.

1208
01:48:06,886 --> 01:48:13,405
Hristo, send four more soldiers to the gate.

1209
01:48:16,606 --> 01:48:18,525
Now we should...

1210
01:48:18,686 --> 01:48:21,605
...go prepare a welcome party for Osman.

1211
01:48:36,206 --> 01:48:38,645
We'll kill you, Sofia.

1212
01:48:40,006 --> 01:48:41,965
We'll kill you.

1213
01:49:05,246 --> 01:49:07,445
Osman's scouts.

1214
01:49:08,326 --> 01:49:11,165
They've already taken positions around.

1215
01:49:47,446 --> 01:49:49,125
This is it, my Bey.

1216
01:49:49,686 --> 01:49:52,965
Even the temple of those
dogs looks like a fortress.

1217
01:49:53,206 --> 01:49:58,485
It doesn't matter, Samil Bey. We
have faith to destroy it, thanks to Allah.

1218
01:49:59,686 --> 01:50:01,365
Alaaddin.

1219
01:50:02,126 --> 01:50:05,205
Get around in the back of the
temple with the alps. Go, son.

1220
01:50:05,206 --> 01:50:07,445
As you order, my Bey. Turahan.

1221
01:50:07,886 --> 01:50:09,965
Alps, come with me.

1222
01:50:12,966 --> 01:50:16,005
Orhan, are the flying flames ready?

1223
01:50:16,206 --> 01:50:18,685
We have enough to destroy the gate, my Bey.

1224
01:50:19,046 --> 01:50:20,645
Don't worry.

1225
01:50:20,766 --> 01:50:22,645
Okay, okay.

1226
01:50:22,926 --> 01:50:26,005
Come on, alps. Grab your shields.

1227
01:50:26,326 --> 01:50:28,285
Draw your swords.

1228
01:50:30,006 --> 01:50:34,085
Today is the vengeance day.

1229
01:50:36,886 --> 01:50:38,645
Here we go.

1230
01:50:56,726 --> 01:51:00,205
They'll attempt to get through the gate.

1231
01:51:01,526 --> 01:51:04,725
I don't want a single Turk
to get inside through it.

1232
01:51:05,246 --> 01:51:07,005
Reinforce it.

1233
01:51:08,886 --> 01:51:12,245
Place archers on the walls.

1234
01:51:13,366 --> 01:51:16,645
Tell them to shoot even the birds approaching!

1235
01:51:20,286 --> 01:51:26,525
Armored soldiers will
stand ready inside the walls.

1236
01:51:28,926 --> 01:51:32,805
They will be the team to slaughter Turks.

1237
01:51:45,886 --> 01:51:48,445
Everybody knows their duties.

1238
01:51:54,846 --> 01:51:59,805
-What are you doing here. Poena?
-Osman knows about the temple.

1239
01:52:00,406 --> 01:52:02,405
They're going to attack here.

1240
01:52:04,486 --> 01:52:06,245
I know.

1241
01:52:08,246 --> 01:52:11,725
This will be the death for Osman and Bala.

1242
01:52:13,726 --> 01:52:16,205
With your own eyes

1243
01:52:18,126 --> 01:52:21,525
...you'll witness that your
revenge has been taken.

1244
01:52:24,206 --> 01:52:28,605
You are the strongest woman I have ever met.

1245
01:52:31,926 --> 01:52:34,125
How will you do that?

1246
01:52:35,486 --> 01:52:37,445
Hristo.

1247
01:52:40,846 --> 01:52:43,205
Send a messenger to Ulugan.

1248
01:52:46,366 --> 01:52:50,085
The battle where Osman
and his kin are wiped out...

1249
01:52:52,606 --> 01:52:54,805
...will take place here.

1250
01:53:01,926 --> 01:53:04,645
We're under attack!
Osman's coming!

1251
01:53:04,926 --> 01:53:06,725
Archers!

1252
01:53:17,406 --> 01:53:18,725
Open!

1253
01:53:22,366 --> 01:53:24,085
Close!

1254
01:53:31,046 --> 01:53:32,485
Open!

1255
01:53:42,286 --> 01:53:43,805
Open!

1256
01:53:47,566 --> 01:53:48,805
Close!

1257
01:54:00,606 --> 01:54:04,845
Osman is attacking our walls, Sofia.
They're coming towards the front gate.

1258
01:54:06,166 --> 01:54:07,605
Let him come.

1259
01:54:08,926 --> 01:54:11,445
I'm the master of death.

1260
01:54:13,286 --> 01:54:16,285
He'll get the most
relentless response in return!

1261
01:54:19,286 --> 01:54:20,925
Hristo.

1262
01:54:21,846 --> 01:54:24,645
Osman will attempt to reach Bala.

1263
01:54:25,006 --> 01:54:27,605
But he will never succeed.

1264
01:54:27,806 --> 01:54:31,965
Build a wall of flesh in
front of Bala's door. Go!

1265
01:54:34,846 --> 01:54:37,445
Did you lock her in my room?
-Yes.

1266
01:54:37,646 --> 01:54:39,845
It's the safest place

1267
01:54:42,686 --> 01:54:44,285
My little bird.

1268
01:54:45,286 --> 01:54:46,765
Don't worry.

1269
01:54:48,126 --> 01:54:51,325
Today is the day when our sufferings will end.

1270
01:54:55,806 --> 01:54:57,525
Tell me now.

1271
01:54:58,606 --> 01:55:01,965
Are you ready for this holy day?

1272
01:55:03,046 --> 01:55:04,165
I'm ready.

1273
01:55:04,286 --> 01:55:07,765
Will you take revenge from those two demons?

1274
01:55:08,606 --> 01:55:12,285
I've been waiting for this day
for years. I'm not afraid of death.

1275
01:55:12,766 --> 01:55:17,165
Even if I bleed and lose my life

1276
01:55:18,846 --> 01:55:21,005
..I will take revenge.

1277
01:55:28,086 --> 01:55:29,485
Turahan.

1278
01:55:30,366 --> 01:55:32,925
Throw it silently.

1279
01:55:39,206 --> 01:55:42,125
I will go first. Follow me.

1280
01:55:42,166 --> 01:55:43,965
As you order, my Shahzade.

1281
01:55:44,446 --> 01:55:46,725
-May Allah bless our fight.
-Aameen.

1282
01:55:46,846 --> 01:55:48,845
In the name of Allah!

1283
01:55:49,566 --> 01:55:51,965
Ya Allah.

1284
01:55:56,526 --> 01:56:00,525
-Hang on, alps! Hang on!
-Open!

1285
01:56:12,086 --> 01:56:14,725
Aykurt, come on

1286
01:56:14,926 --> 01:56:16,765
Prepare the flying flames.

1287
01:56:16,846 --> 01:56:19,845
-Aykut!
-They're ready, Aykurt Cavus.

1288
01:56:23,726 --> 01:56:25,485
Aykurt!

1289
01:56:38,286 --> 01:56:39,765
Open!

1290
01:56:39,846 --> 01:56:42,085
Ya Allah!

1291
01:56:48,606 --> 01:56:50,365
Open!

1292
01:57:01,486 --> 01:57:03,805
Come on, warriors! Attack!

1293
01:57:06,326 --> 01:57:09,765
-Allah Allah! Allah Allah!
-Attack!

1294
01:57:22,006 --> 01:57:23,445
Fight, brothers!

1295
01:57:40,366 --> 01:57:43,805
Cut off their heads! Come on!

1296
01:58:06,846 --> 01:58:10,085
Fight for our martyrs! Fight, brothers!

1297
01:58:10,246 --> 01:58:12,125
Allah is the greatest!

1298
01:58:38,886 --> 01:58:40,405
What if Osman doesn't come?

1299
01:58:40,646 --> 01:58:43,645
Osman won't leave his wife alone against death.

1300
01:58:43,846 --> 01:58:47,165
Today both Osman and Bala are going to die.

1301
01:58:58,086 --> 01:59:01,325
Turks are coming!
Turks are coming!

1302
01:59:03,126 --> 01:59:05,325
Come here.

1303
01:59:07,286 --> 01:59:09,565
They can't go anywhere!

1304
01:59:09,646 --> 01:59:13,685
-They're coming to their death.
-Show no mercy. Kill them all!

1305
01:59:43,686 --> 01:59:45,645
Allah is the greatest!

1306
02:00:37,086 --> 02:00:40,805
Sofia, I'm here to destroy your nest.

1307
02:00:41,166 --> 02:00:46,805
I'll hit you in the heart. Soldiers, attack!

1308
02:01:26,566 --> 02:01:28,325
Orhan!

1309
02:01:29,566 --> 02:01:32,085
Take care of Sofia. I'm going for Bala.

1310
02:01:32,246 --> 02:01:35,205
Save my mother, my Bey! I got this!

1311
02:01:46,446 --> 02:01:48,445
Sofia.

1312
02:01:51,606 --> 02:01:54,485
You'll never be able to reach Bala.

1313
02:01:54,606 --> 02:01:57,125
Where are you going, Sofia?

1314
02:01:57,246 --> 02:02:01,405
First... You first should taste my sword.

1315
02:02:01,566 --> 02:02:04,885
Orhan, you're first that I will kill, huh?

1316
02:02:05,086 --> 02:02:06,805
We will see.

1317
02:02:19,526 --> 02:02:22,885
Come on, come on.

1318
02:02:22,966 --> 02:02:24,845
Come on!

1319
02:02:25,886 --> 02:02:28,605
This way, hurry up!

1320
02:02:35,526 --> 02:02:37,485
I will get out of here.

1321
02:02:38,006 --> 02:02:39,925
I will come for you, my Halime.

1322
02:02:40,006 --> 02:02:44,045
Even during your absence, you help your mother.

1323
02:02:44,806 --> 02:02:47,965
I promise I will find you, my daughter.

1324
02:02:48,526 --> 02:02:52,685
I will find you. Come on!

1325
02:03:05,686 --> 02:03:08,085
Come on, come on!

1326
02:03:08,206 --> 02:03:11,125
I will never feel sorry for you, Bala.

1327
02:03:12,486 --> 02:03:16,245
You deserve even worse.

1328
02:03:19,006 --> 02:03:21,285
Why are they so late?

1329
02:03:23,326 --> 02:03:25,285
Be patient.

1330
02:03:25,606 --> 02:03:27,405
When Osman dies.

1331
02:03:27,846 --> 02:03:30,205
...you will sit on the throne easily.

1332
02:03:30,806 --> 02:03:35,165
Besides, Osman is really going to die.

1333
02:03:35,646 --> 02:03:37,765
Not like Bala.

1334
02:03:39,006 --> 02:03:41,645
As a man existing under Ulugan's shadow,

1335
02:03:41,886 --> 02:03:44,485
...you are too confident, Altuga.

1336
02:03:45,726 --> 02:03:49,165
-Don't make a mistake and ruin things.
-Enough!

1337
02:03:54,606 --> 02:03:56,045
Someone's coming.

1338
02:03:56,366 --> 02:03:58,845
We will find out now.

1339
02:04:02,686 --> 02:04:05,285
Speak. Where is Sofia?

1340
02:04:05,366 --> 02:04:08,765
Osman attacked the temple.

1341
02:04:09,726 --> 02:04:12,445
I knew. He's going to save Bala.

1342
02:04:13,086 --> 02:04:14,525
What now?

1343
02:04:14,926 --> 02:04:16,325
Osman..

1344
02:04:18,206 --> 02:04:21,085
We'll bring their dark fate to them.

1345
02:04:21,566 --> 02:04:24,325
We'll present the death to them with our swords.

1346
02:04:24,846 --> 02:04:27,845
We're going to the temple.

1347
02:04:39,766 --> 02:04:42,925
I'm here, my Bala. I'm here.

1348
02:04:47,286 --> 02:04:51,405
Osman's coming!

1349
02:04:53,526 --> 02:04:55,245
Osman

1350
02:04:56,366 --> 02:05:01,205
Osman! I'm here, Osman!

1351
02:05:12,446 --> 02:05:14,485
Osman! Osman!

1352
02:05:14,486 --> 02:05:17,565
I am here! -Bala!

1353
02:05:17,846 --> 02:05:20,205
Osman! -Bala

1354
02:05:21,006 --> 02:05:22,445
My Bala, I found you!

1355
02:05:33,086 --> 02:05:35,525
Now it is time for you to die, you red demon.

1356
02:05:35,526 --> 02:05:37,845
I will let you come together with Lukas!

1357
02:05:41,646 --> 02:05:45,445
Osman is saving Bala, Sofia!

1358
02:05:46,646 --> 02:05:49,285
Not yet, Orhan!

1359
02:05:49,806 --> 02:05:51,445
Run!

1360
02:05:56,526 --> 02:05:58,445
We will kill you sooner or later!

1361
02:06:11,246 --> 02:06:13,325
Allah is Eternal!

1362
02:06:30,606 --> 02:06:33,925
We need to kill more of them now!

1363
02:06:42,126 --> 02:06:45,005
Bala!

1364
02:06:45,366 --> 02:06:49,525
I am here.
-Bala...

1365
02:06:49,526 --> 02:06:53,005
Are you alright?
-I am alright. Are you alright?

1366
02:06:53,046 --> 02:06:57,925
I am. Come here. Come.

1367
02:07:00,766 --> 02:07:01,925
Osman.

1368
02:07:01,926 --> 02:07:05,525
Osman, we need to find Sofia. Only
she knows where our daughter is.

1369
02:07:07,046 --> 02:07:09,805
Bala, what are you saying? Bala?

1370
02:07:10,446 --> 02:07:13,685
Do not let Sofia trick you. Bala!

1371
02:07:13,966 --> 02:07:15,445
Halime died.

1372
02:07:16,646 --> 02:07:21,445
Osman, I am telling the truth! I am telling
the truth! Sofia told me everything!

1373
02:07:21,526 --> 02:07:23,685
Look, she raised Halime here!

1374
02:07:23,686 --> 02:07:27,765
Her bed, her clothes, her smell, her comb...

1375
02:07:30,406 --> 02:07:33,405
Bala, we need to leave this
place as soon as possible.

1376
02:07:33,406 --> 02:07:35,525
We'll leave and we will
talk about it on the way.

1377
02:07:35,526 --> 02:07:38,085
We will face that dog if necessary. Come on.

1378
02:07:38,086 --> 02:07:39,885
Come on.

1379
02:07:40,046 --> 02:07:43,765
Look, if Halime is alive...

1380
02:07:44,246 --> 02:07:45,525
...don't worry...

1381
02:07:46,926 --> 02:07:48,565
...we will find my daughter.

1382
02:07:49,166 --> 02:07:53,405
Alright? -We will find her!

1383
02:07:54,686 --> 02:07:57,085
Come on, walk. Come on, Bala!

1384
02:08:01,166 --> 02:08:02,445
Come on!

1385
02:08:05,886 --> 02:08:07,645
Hold every place in the castle!

1386
02:08:08,126 --> 02:08:10,885
They will never get out of here.

1387
02:08:13,006 --> 02:08:14,165
Aunt!

1388
02:08:14,886 --> 02:08:16,085
Aunt!

1389
02:08:16,166 --> 02:08:19,085
Osman saved Bala. They are leaving.

1390
02:08:20,406 --> 02:08:21,765
We are losing...

1391
02:08:21,766 --> 02:08:25,405
We never lose, my little bird. Trust your aunt.

1392
02:08:25,726 --> 02:08:28,365
They will never get out of here.

1393
02:08:29,926 --> 02:08:32,605
We will take our revenge today.

1394
02:08:32,686 --> 02:08:34,845
Come on, come with me.

1395
02:09:00,446 --> 02:09:05,405
Catch that demon called
Sofia! Destroy that place!

1396
02:09:06,486 --> 02:09:10,725
We will find her brother! We will dry up
the seeds of fitna and establish peace.

1397
02:09:14,086 --> 02:09:17,045
-For our martyrs!
-Allah is the Greatest!

1398
02:09:47,886 --> 02:09:52,005
-Come on!
-Allah is the Greatest!

1399
02:09:59,246 --> 02:10:00,285
They are here!

1400
02:10:04,366 --> 02:10:07,325
You have no where to go. Drop your swords.

1401
02:10:08,166 --> 02:10:12,565
First, I will pierce your
hearts. Come at me! Come on!

1402
02:10:26,846 --> 02:10:28,885
Halime..

1403
02:10:35,686 --> 02:10:37,485
My Allah, keep me sane...

1404
02:10:37,486 --> 02:10:40,365
My Halime, is that you?

1405
02:10:40,366 --> 02:10:41,645
Osman, I saw my Halime!

1406
02:10:41,646 --> 02:10:45,445
-I saw my Halime, Osman!
Sofia is taking her away -Bala!

1407
02:10:50,966 --> 02:10:52,685
Bala!

1408
02:10:59,046 --> 02:11:00,085
Come on

1409
02:11:02,446 --> 02:11:03,565
Sofia!

1410
02:11:05,366 --> 02:11:10,805
-Bala!
-Don't take a single step, Sofia!

1411
02:11:16,206 --> 02:11:18,045
It's my Halime! I know!

1412
02:11:19,246 --> 02:11:20,285
How?

1413
02:11:25,606 --> 02:11:27,685
Osman. Come, look!

1414
02:11:27,926 --> 02:11:28,965
Look!

1415
02:11:30,366 --> 02:11:32,165
We found our daughter!

1416
02:11:32,766 --> 02:11:34,805
That is Halime standing over there.

1417
02:11:44,846 --> 02:11:47,245
What are you saying Bala?

1418
02:11:47,246 --> 02:11:49,245
Halime..

1419
02:11:57,926 --> 02:12:00,245
Bala is telling the truth Osman.

1420
02:12:01,526 --> 02:12:03,245
You found your daughter.

1421
02:12:10,806 --> 02:12:12,885
Bala..

1422
02:12:18,286 --> 02:12:20,205
Look at me..

1423
02:12:21,926 --> 02:12:24,525
Look at me, you red dog...

1424
02:12:24,886 --> 02:12:27,885
Are you telling the truth?

1425
02:12:27,926 --> 02:12:29,925
Even if you are telling the truth..

1426
02:12:30,006 --> 02:12:32,805
...or not, I will send you to hell!

1427
02:12:33,406 --> 02:12:34,685
Halime!

1428
02:12:36,046 --> 02:12:38,485
Stay where you are.

1429
02:12:41,486 --> 02:12:42,845
Soldiers!

1430
02:12:52,206 --> 02:12:54,085
You found your daughter.

1431
02:12:55,606 --> 02:13:00,565
But you will never be able to have her.

1432
02:13:02,126 --> 02:13:04,365
Before I kill you...

1433
02:13:05,166 --> 02:13:10,005
...tell me the truth. For the last time.

1434
02:13:10,686 --> 02:13:12,245
For the last time.

1435
02:13:13,246 --> 02:13:14,685
The truth?

1436
02:13:16,646 --> 02:13:19,405
The truth is standing before you.

1437
02:13:22,166 --> 02:13:23,565
Before I..

1438
02:13:24,926 --> 02:13:26,965
...send you to death...

1439
02:13:28,686 --> 02:13:30,885
...I will do one last favor.

1440
02:13:34,206 --> 02:13:37,525
The last face you see...

1441
02:13:37,886 --> 02:13:39,485
...will be your daughter...

1442
02:13:39,966 --> 02:13:41,805
..Halime's.

1443
02:13:52,366 --> 02:13:53,445
Halime.

1444
02:14:04,046 --> 02:14:08,485
You..

1445
02:14:10,606 --> 02:14:12,565
Is she...

1446
02:14:26,086 --> 02:14:27,485
Osman, it's her...

1447
02:14:36,046 --> 02:14:37,605
How is this possible?